  <para style="h">Kpo Jemi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kpo Jemi Nɛ Yohane Na</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kpo Jemi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kje</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kpo Jemi Nɛ Yohane Na</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Womi nɛ ɔ tsɔɔ níhi nɛ maa ba hwɔɔ se ngɛ Yesu Kristo wami si himi mi. Mawu ngmɛ lɛ blɔ nɛ e je ni nɛ ɔmɛ kpo kɛ tsɔɔ e sɔmɔlɔ Yohane ngɛ ni nami mi. Nɛ e tsɔ bɔfo kɛ je hiɔwe kɛ ba nɛ e ba tsɔɔ ni nami ɔ sisi. <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />Nɛ Yohane ngma Mawu kɛ Yesu Kristo munyu ɔmɛ nɛ e nu ɔ kɛ níhi nɛ e na amɛ tsuo pɛpɛɛpɛ.<verse eid="REV 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Ke ji o kane kikɛmɛ a gbami munyu nɛ ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ asafo ɔ, o ma na jɔɔmi pɔtɛɛ ko kɛ je Nutsɔ ɔ dɛ. Nihi nɛ maa bu munyu ɔ tue nɛ a maa pee níhi nɛ a de ɔ, mɛ hu a maa jɔɔ mɛ. Ejakaa be nɛ ní nɛ ɔmɛ maa ba a su ta. <verse eid="REV 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />Nɛ Yohane ngma kɛ ya ha asafohi kpaago nɛ ngɛ Asia zugba a nɔ ɔ ke: Dloomi kɛ he jɔmi nɛ je Mawu, nɔ nɛ ngɛ ɔ, kɛ nɔ nɛ hi si sa a, kɛ nɔ nɛ maa ba a, kɛ mumihi kpaago nɛ ngɛ e matsɛ sɛ ɔ hɛ mi ɔ dɛ mi ha nyɛ. <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />Dloomi kɛ he jɔmi nɛ je Yesu Kristo hu dɛ mi ɔ kɛ ha nyɛ, lɛ nɔ nɛ e je anɔkuale ɔ tsuo kpo kɛ tsɔɔ wɔ ɔ. Lɛ ji kekle nɔ nɛ te si kɛ je gbeje, nɛ e be gboe hu. E kle pe zugba a nɔ matsɛ ɔmɛ tsuo. A je e yi, lɛ nɔ nɛ suɔ wɔ nɛ e ngɔ e muɔ kɛ kpɔ wɔ kɛ je wa he yayami ɔmɛ a mi ɔ. <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />Nɛ e ngɔ wɔ kɛ wo e matsɛ yemi ɔ mi nɛ e pee wɔ osɔfohi kɛ ha e Tsɛ ɔ. Lɛ a ngɔ neneene anunyami kɛ nɔ yemi kɛ ha.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />Hyɛ, e ma kɛ bɔ kuu ɔmɛ, nɛ nɔ fɛɛ nɔ maa na lɛ, kɛ nihi nɛ gbɔ lɛ nɔ́ ɔ tete, nɛ zugba a nɔ bimɛ tsuo ma fo ya ngɛ e he. E ba mi ja. Amen.<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />Nutsɔ Mawu ɔ ke, “Ami ji A kɛ Z, Sisije kɛ Nyagbe,” nɔ nɛ ngɛ, kɛ nɔ nɛ hi si sa a, kɛ nɔ nɛ maa ba a, Mawu Ope ɔ.<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Ami nyɛ nyɛminyumu Yohane nɛ ngɛ nyɛ womi nɛ ɔ ngmae, nɔ nɛ e kɛ nyɛ tsuo na nɔ́ ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ he ɔ. Ami hu i na Yesu tsui si tomi ngɛ amanehlu mi ɔ eko, nɛ wa nine maa su e matsɛ yemi ɔ nɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:9">A je mi we kɛ ho Patmo wo kpɔ ɔ nɔ ya ngɛ Mawu munyu ɔ nɛ i fiɛ, kɛ nɔ́ nɛ i le nɛ i de ngɛ Yesu Kristo he ɔ he je.<verse eid="REV 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anunyami nihi nɛ Yohane na a sisije</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Mumi ɔ ba ye nɔ benɛ i ngɛ sɔlee ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ ligbi ɔ nɔ, nɛ i nu gbi wawɛɛ ko kaa tɛtlɛmatlɛ gbi ngɛ ye se; <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />nɛ e de mi ke, “Ngmaa nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ o ngɛ nae ɔ ngɛ womi mi, nɛ o kɛ mane asafohi kpaago nɛ ngɛ Efeso, Smirna, Pergami, Tiatira, Sarde, Filadelfia kɛ Laodikea.”<verse eid="REV 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Benɛ i plɛ ye he nɛ ma hyɛ nɔ nɛ ngɛ munyu ɔ tue ɔ, i na sika tsu kane tsohi kpaago, <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />kɛ nɔ ko nɛ ngɛ kaa Yesu Kristo, nɔ nɛ tsɛ e he ke Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ, ngɛ kane tso kpaago ɔmɛ a kpɛti. E wo tade klɔii nɛ e kɛ kpa nɛ ngɛ kaa sika tsu fi e kpɛti. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />E yi bwɔmi hiɔ futafuta kaa klala, nɛ e hɛ ngmɛ tsuɔ kaa la. <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />E nanehi a he ngɛ kpɛe kaa ayawa nɛ a tsu he, nɛ e gbi he wa kaa oslɔkehi nɛ ngɛ kue. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />E hɛɛ dodoehi kpaago ngɛ e hiɔ nine mi, nɛ hiɔ̃ nya enyɔtsɛ, nɛ nya ba, ngɛ e nya mi. E hɛ mi ngɛ kpɛe kaa piani pu.<verse eid="REV 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Benɛ i na lɛ ɔ, i nɔ si ngɛ e nane nya nɛ i pee kaa nɔ nɛ gbo. Kɛkɛ nɛ e kɛ e hiɔ nine fɔ ye nɔ nɛ e de mi ke, “Koo ye gbeye! Ami ji Kekle kɛ Nyagbe nɔ ɔ, <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />kɛ Hɛ kalɔ ɔ! I gbo se ye hɛ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene; nɛ i hɛɛ gbeje kɛ gbenɔ nya safie ɔmɛ. <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, ngmaa níhi nɛ o na a, kɛ níhi nɛ a ma je kɛ tsɔɔ mo ngɛ enɛ ɔmɛ a se ɔ. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Dodoehi kpaago nɛ o na ngɛ ye hiɔ nine mi kɛ sika tsu kane tsohi kpaago ɔ a sisi tsɔɔmi ji: dodoehi kpaago ɔmɛ ji asafohi kpaago ɔmɛ a nya bɔfohi, nɛ kane tsohi kpaago ɔmɛ ji asafohi kpaago ɔmɛ nɛ.”<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />“Ngmaa womi kɛ ya ha Efeso asafo ɔ bɔfo ɔ ke:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:1">Munyuhi nɛ nɔ nɛ hɛɛ dodoehi kpaago ngɛ e hiɔ nine mi, nɛ e nyɛɛ ngɛ sika tsu kane tso kpaago ɔmɛ a kpɛti ɔ de ji nɛ ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />I le o ni peemi ɔmɛ, o dengme gbomi kɛ o tsui si tomi ɔ. Nɛ i le bɔ nɛ o sume nimli yayahi ha, nɛ o kaa nihi nɛ peeɔ a he kaa bɔfohi se a pi ja a. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />Nɛ ngɛ ye he je ɔ, o toɔ o tsui si, nɛ o naa amanehlu, nɛ pɔ tɔɛ o he.<verse eid="REV 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Se kɛ ɔ, nɔ́ ko ngɛ nɛ dɛ ha mi ngɛ o he. Lɔ ɔ ji, o sume mi kaa bɔ nɛ o suɔ mi sa a. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Mo kai bɔ nɛ o suɔ mi kekle ɔ, konɛ o tsake o tsui, nɛ o hi si kaa kekle ɔ, ke pi ja a, ma ba o ngɔ nɛ ma ba je o kane tso ɔ kɛ je e ma he ɔ.<verse eid="REV 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Se nɔ́ kake nɛ ngɛ o he nɛ hi ji kaa, o sume Nikolaime a ni tsumi ɔmɛ kaa bɔ nɛ imi hu i sume ɔ.<verse eid="REV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />Nɔ nɛ ngɛ tue ɔ, e nu nɔ́ nɛ Mumi ɔ ngɛ asafo ɔmɛ dee ɔ. I ma ha kunimi yelɔ ɔ he blɔ nɛ e ye wami tso ɔ nɛ ngɛ Mawu Paradeiso ɔ mi ɔ nɔ yiblii ɔ eko.<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />Moo ngma womi nɛ ɔ kɛ ya ha Smirna asafo ɔ bɔfo ɔ nɛ o de lɛ ke:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:8">Nɔ́ nɛ Kekle no ɔ kɛ Nyagbe no ɔ, nɔ nɛ gbo nɛ e te si kɛ je gbeje ɔ de ji enɛ ɔ nɛ:<verse eid="REV 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />I le o ni tsumi ɔmɛ kɛ o haomi ɔmɛ kɛ o ohia a, se kɛ ɔ, niatsɛ ji mo ngɛ mumi mi. I le ni yayahi nɛ o he nyɛli ɔmɛ deɔ ngɛ o he. A tsɛɔ a he Yuda bi, nɛ ji Mawu bimɛ, se a pi ja, ejakaa Abosiami ni tsumi nɛ a tsuɔ. <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Mo ko ye amanehlu nɛ maa ba o nɔ ɔ he gbeye; Abosiami maa ngɔ nyɛ ti ni komɛ ngɔ wo tsu mi nɛ a ka nyɛ, nɛ nyɛ maa na amanehlu ‘ligbi nyɔngma.’ Moo pee anɔkualetsɛ kɛ ya si gbenɔ mi, nɛ ma ha mo wami jlasi ɔ. <verse eid="REV 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />Nɔ nɛ ngɛ tue ɔ, e nu nɔ́ nɛ Mumi ɔ ngɛ asafo ɔmɛ dee ɔ. Nɔ nɛ maa ye kunimi ɔ, a be lɛ nɔ́ yaya ko pee ngɛ gbenɔ nɛ ji enyɔ ɔ mi.<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />Ngmaa kɛ ya ha Pergamo asafo ɔ bɔfo ɔ ke:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:12">Níhi nɛ nɔ nɛ hɛɛ hiɔ̃ nya enyɔtsɛ nɛ nya ba a de ji enɛ ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />I le o sihi he, he nɛ Abosiami matsɛ sɛ ɔ ngɛ nɛ a jaa lɛ wawɛɛ ɔ. Se kɛ ɔ, o ngɛ ye se nyɛɛe kɛ sa. Nɛ benɛ Abosiami se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ gbe Antipa, ye he anɔkuale odase yelɔ ɔ ngɛ nyɛ kpɛti tete ɔ, o kua we mi.<verse eid="REV 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />Se kɛ ɔ, i kɛ mo ngɛ munyu bɔɔ ko, ejakaa o ngɛ nihi ngɛ lejɛ ɔ nɛ nyɛɛɔ Balaam tsɔɔmi ɔ se, nɔ nɛ ha Balak mlɔɔ Israel bi ɔmɛ nɛ a ye níhi nɛ a kɛ sã bɔ kɛ ha wɔhi, nɛ a bɔ ajuama, nɛ ha a nane tɔtɔ. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Ja a nɔuu kɛ o ngɛ nihi nɛ hɛɛ Nikolai bi ɔmɛ a tsɔɔmi ɔ mi.<verse eid="REV 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, mo tsake o tsui; ke pi ja a, i ma ba tlukaa nɛ i kɛ mɛ maa hwu ta kɛ ye nya mi hiɔ̃ ɔ. <verse eid="REV 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />Nɔ nɛ ngɛ tue ɔ, e nu nɔ́ nɛ Mumi ɔ ngɛ asafo ɔmɛ dee ɔ. Nɔ nɛ maa ye kunimi ɔ, ma ha lɛ mana nɛ a kɛ laa a eko nɛ e ye. Nɛ i ma ha lɛ tɛ hiɔ nɛ a ngma biɛ he nɛ nɔ ko li ngɛ nɔ, ja lɛ pɛ.<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />Moo ngma womi nɛ ɔ kɛ ya ha Tiatira asafo ɔ bɔfo ɔ nɛ o de lɛ ke,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:18">Sɛ nɛ je Mawu Bi ɔ nɛ e hɛ ngmɛ tsuɔ kaa la, nɛ e nanehi a he ngɛ kpɛe kaa ayawa a ji enɛ ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="REV 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />I le o ni tsumi ɔmɛ, o suɔmi kɛ o hemi kɛ yemi ɔ, o sɔmɔmi kɛ o tsui si tomi ɔ, nɛ i na kaa o piɔ ni tsumi ɔmɛ hi pe kekle ní ɔmɛ.<verse eid="REV 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Se kɛ ɔ, nɔ́ nɛ i sume ngɛ o he ji kaa, o ha Yesebel, jamɛ a yo ɔ nɛ tsɛɛ e he gbalɔ ɔ, he blɔ nɛ e tsɔɔ ye sɔmɔli ɔmɛ ajuama bɔmi, nɛ e haa a yeɔ niye ni nɛ a kɛ sã bɔ ha wɔhi. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />I ha lɛ be nɛ e kɛ tsake e tsui, se e tsakee we. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, i ma ngɔ hiɔ nɛ nya wa kɛ fɔ e nɔ, kɛ e ajuama bɔli ɔmɛ tsuo. A maa na nɔ́ saminya, ja mɛ tsuo a tsake. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />Nɛ i ma kpata e se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ a hɛ mi, nɛ asafo ɔmɛ tsuo ma na maa le kaa ami ji nɔ nɛ leɔ nimli a juɛmi kɛ a susumihi. Nɛ i ma wo nyɛ ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ hiɔ ngɛ e ni tsumi nya.<verse eid="REV 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />Se nyɛ Tiatira bimɛ nɛ he we tsɔɔmi nɛ ɔ yi, nɛ nyɛ kase we nɔ́ nɛ nihi tsɛɛ ke Abosiami nihi nɛ a mi kuɔ ɔmɛ ɔ, i ngɛ nyɛ dee ke i be tlomi kpa ko woe kɛ fɔ nyɛ nɔ. <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />Se mohu, nyɛɛ hɛɛ nɔ́ nɛ nyɛ le ɔ mi kpɛii kɛ ya si be nɛ ma ba.<verse eid="REV 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />Nɔ nɛ maa hɛɛ ye ni tsumi ɔ mi kɛ ya si nyagbe nɛ e maa ye kunimi ɔ, i ma ha lɛ he wami ngɛ ma amɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="REV 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />O maa ye a nɔ kɛ nine si wami kaa bɔ nɛ ye Tsɛ ha mi he wami kaa ma ye a nɔ ɔ. Nɛ o maa gbɛ mɛ dugudugu kaa bɔ nɛ a ywiaa buɛ ɔ. <verse eid="REV 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />Nɛ i ma ha mo neneene wami kaa dodoe ngɛ hiɔwe.<verse eid="REV 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />Nɔ nɛ ngɛ tue ɔ, e nu nɔ́ nɛ Mumi ɔ ngɛ asafo ɔmɛ dee ɔ.”<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />“Ngmaa kɛ ya ha Sarde asafo ɔ bɔfo ɔ ke:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:1">Sɛ nɛ je nɔ nɛ hɛɛ Mawu mumihi kpaago kɛ dodoehi kpaago ɔ ngɔ ji enɛ ɔ nɛ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:1">I le mo kaa asafo nɛ hɛɛ biɛ gu, o ni tsumi ɔmɛ hí, nɛ o gbo ngɛ mumi mi. <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, o hɛ nɛ tsiɛ nɛ o wo o hemi kɛ yemi ɔ mi la, ejakaa bɔɔ ɔ nɛ piɛ ɔ hu miɔ nɛ e ma gbo. Nɛ i nɛ o ni tsumi ɔmɛ kaa a da ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Mo kai nɔ́ nɛ a tsɔɔ mo nɛ o he ye kekle ɔ. Mo tsake o tsui nɛ o pɛtɛ he wawɛɛ. Ke o tsakee we ɔ, i ma ba o ngɔ tlukaa kaa julɔ, nɛ i ma ba gbla o tue; se o be lee ngmlɛfia nɔ nɛ i ma ba kulaa.<verse eid="REV 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Se kɛ ɔ, ni komɛ ngɛ Sarde nɛ wui a tade ɔmɛ mu kɛ je ɔ mi ni yayamihi. Nimli nɛ ɔmɛ a kɛ mi maa nyɛɛ ngɛ tade hiɔhi a mi, ejakaa a sa ja. <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ maa ye kunimi ɔ, a maa wo lɛ tade hiɔ, nɛ i be e biɛ gbee ngɛ Wami Womi ɔ mi gblee, nɛ ma wo e biɛ ta ngɛ ye Tsɛ kɛ e bɔfo ɔmɛ a he mi.<verse eid="REV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />Nɔ nɛ ngɛ tue ɔ, e nu nɔ́ nɛ mumi ɔ ngɛ asafo ɔmɛ dee ɔ.<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />Moo ngma womi nɛ ɔ kɛ ya ha Filadelfia asafo ɔ bɔfo ɔ nɛ o de lɛ ke,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:7">Enɛ ɔ ji sɛ nɛ je nɔ klɔuklɔu ɔ kɛ anɔkualetsɛ ɔ ngɔ. Nɔ nɛ hɛɛ David safie ɔ. E ngaa nɛ nɔ ko nyɛ we blimi, nɛ e bliɔ nɛ nɔ ko nyɛ we ngami.<verse eid="REV 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />I le mo saminya, nɛ i le kaa o gbɔjɔ mohu se o kua we mi. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, i bli sinya kɛ ha mo, nɛ nɔ ko be nyɛe ma nga.<verse eid="REV 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />Moo bu tue! Jamɛ a Abosiami jali ɔmɛ nɛ deɔ ke Yuda bi ji mɛ, se lakpa nɛ a ngɛ yee ɔ, i ma ha nɛ a ba kpla si ngɛ o nane nya konɛ a le kaa i suɔ mo.<verse eid="REV 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Akɛnɛ o to o tsui si nɛ o ye ye mlaa a nɔ ngɛ amanehlu mi tete he je ɔ, i ma baa o yi ngɛ nɔ́ nami nɛ maa ba je ɔ nɔ, nɛ a ma kɛ ka nihi tsuo ngɛ zugba a nɔ ɔ mi. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />Hyɛ, i ma nɔuu! Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, moo pɛtɛ o hemi kɛ yemi ɔ mi nɛ wa, konɛ nɔ ko nɛ ko kpɔ o jlasi ɔ ngɛ o dɛ.<verse eid="REV 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />Nɛ nɔ nɛ maa ye kunimi ɔ, i ma ha e pi si ngɛ Mawu we ɔ, nɛ e be lejɛ ɔ jee gbleegbleegblee. I ma ngma ye Mawu ɔ kɛ Yerusalem he ɔ biɛ, kɛ ami nitsɛ ye biɛ ngɛ e he, nɛ e ma plɛ Yerusalem he nɛ maa je hiɔwe kɛ ba a mi bi.<verse eid="REV 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />Nɔ nɛ ngɛ tue ɔ, e nu nɔ́ nɛ Mumi ɔ ngɛ asafo ɔmɛ dee ɔ.<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />Moo ngma kɛ ya ha Laodikea asafo ɔ bɔfo ɔ ke,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:14">Enɛ ɔ ji sɛ nɛ je Amen, anɔkuale odase yelɔ kɛ Mawu adebɔ sisi jelɔ ɔ ngɔ:<verse eid="REV 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />I le bɔ nɛ o ngɛ ha. O be yluduu nɛ o be kɛlakɛla hulɔ. I na nɛ o ngɛ yluduu loo kɛlakɛla. <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Se akɛnɛ o ngɛ kulɔkulɔ, nɛ o be yluduu loo kɛlakɛla he je ɔ, ma la mo ngɛ ye nya mi ngɔ pue he.<verse eid="REV 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />O deɔ ke, ‘Niatsɛ ji mi nɛ i ngɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ, nɛ nɔ́ ko nɔ ko he hia we mi.’ Se o li kaa o ngɛ dengme mi, nɛ o ni ngɛ mɔbɔ hulɔ. Ejakaa ohiafo kɛ nɔmlɔ nɛ hɛɛ e he gu kɛ hɛ yuyuilɔ ji mo ngɛ mumi mi.<verse eid="REV 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, i ngɛ mo ga woe kaa o he sika tsu kpakpa nɛ a kɛ la tsu he kɛ je ye ngɔ; nɛ ja lɔ ɔ loko ji o maa pee niatsɛ anɔkuale mi. Nɛ jehanɛ ɔ hu o he tade hiɔhi kɛ je ye dɛ, tadehi nɛ a he tsɔ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ o ko hɛɛ o he gu nɛ zo nɛ pee mo. Nɛ o na tsopa hu kɛ je ye dɛ nɛ o kɛ tsa o hɛ ngmɛ ɔ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ o hyɛ nɔ́ ekohu. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />I pɔɔ nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ i suɔ lɛ ɔ tue gblami. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, i ma gbla o tue, ja o tsake o subai nɛ o na Mawu níhi a he bua jɔmi.<verse eid="REV 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />Hyɛ, i daa si ngɛ sinya a nya, nɛ i ngɛ sie be fɛɛ be. Ke nɔ ko nu he kaa i ngɛ lɛ tsɛe nɛ e bli sinya a, i ma ba e ngɔ nɛ i kɛ lɛ maa ye ni, nɛ lɛ hu e kɛ mi maa ye. <verse eid="REV 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />I ma ha nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ maa ye kunimi ɔ maa hi ye kasa nya ngɛ ye matsɛ sɛ ɔ nɔ, kaa hɔ nɛ i hi ye Tsɛ kasa nya ngɛ e matsɛ sɛ ɔ nɔ benɛ i ye kunimi ɔ. <verse eid="REV 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />Nɔ nɛ ngɛ tue ɔ, e nu nɔ́ nɛ Mumi ɔ ngɛ asafo ɔmɛ dee ɔ.”<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s1">Hiɔwe sinya nɛ a bli ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, i hyɛ nɛ i na sinya ko nɛ a bli ngɛ hiɔwe. Nɛ gbi ko pɛ kaa tɛtlɛmatlɛ nɛ e kɛ mi tu munyu kekle ɔ de mi ke, “Moo kuɔ kɛ ba hiɛ ɔ nɛ ma tsɔɔ mo nɔ́ nɛ maa ba ngɛ enɛ ɔ se.”<verse eid="REV 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Amlɔ ɔ nɔuu ɔ, Mumi ɔ ba ye nɔ, nɛ i na matsɛ sɛ ko ngɛ hiɔwe nɛ nɔ ko hii si ngɛ nɔ. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Nɔ nɛ hii si ngɛ sɛ ɔ nɔ ɔ ngɛ kpɛe kaa sika tsu mimi ko. Alale bɔle matsɛ sɛ ɔ nɛ e ngɛ kpɛe kaa tɛ nɛ hɛɛ ba mumu su.<verse eid="REV 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Matsɛ sɛhi nyingmi enyɔ kɛ eywiɛ kpahi nɛ nikɔtɔmahi nyingmi enyɔ kɛ eywiɛ hii si ngɛ a nɔ ɔ bɔle matsɛ sɛ ɔ kɛ kpe. A wo tade hiɔhi nɛ a ngɔ sika tsu jlasi kɛ bu a yi. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />I na oslabai gbami, nɛ i nu hiɔwe simi he kɛ je matsɛ sɛ ɔ mi, nɛ kanehi kpaago nɛ daa si kɛ ha Mawu Mumihi kpaago ɔ ngɛ tsoe ngɛ matsɛ sɛ ɔ hɛ mi. <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Nɛ nɔ́ ko kaa wo ngɛ kpɛe kaa ahuhuɛ ngɛ matsɛ sɛ ɔ hɛ mi. Nɛ nihi eywiɛ komɛ nɛ ngɛ he ngmlɛ, nɛ a ngɛ hɛ ngmɛhi babauu ɔ, a bɔle matsɛ sɛ ɔ. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Ni nɛ ɔmɛ a kpɛti kekle nɔ ɔ ngɛ kaa jata. Nɛ nɔ nɛ ji enyɔ ɔ ngɛ kaa na. Etɛne ɔ hɛ mi ngɛ kaa nɔmlɔ. Nɔ nɛ ji eywiɛ ɔ ngɛ kaa kɔle nɛ ngɛ tee. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Ni nɛ ɔmɛ a ti eko fɛɛ eko ngɛ pɛli ekpa. Hɛ ngme ngɛ a pɛli ɔmɛ a he fɛɛ he, nɛ a ngɛ lae nyɔ kɛ pia ke, “Klɔuklɔu, klɔuklɔu, klɔuklɔu ji Nutsɔ Mawu Ope, nɔ nɛ ngɛ sa a, kɛ nɔ nɛ ngɛ piɔ ɔ, kɛ nɔ nɛ maa ba a.”<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Nɛ benɛ hɛ kali eywiɛ ɔmɛ ngɔ anunyami kɛ agbo jemi kɛ sina kɛ ngɛ nɔ nɛ hii si ngɛ matsɛ sɛ ɔ nɔ, nɛ ngɛ kɛ je neneene kɛ yaa neneene ɔ hae ɔ, <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />nikɔtɔmahi nyingmi enyɔ kɛ eywiɛ ɔ kpla si ngɛ e hɛ mi nɛ a ja lɛ. A ngɔ a jlasi ɔmɛ ngɔ pue matsɛ sɛ ɔ hɛ mi nɛ a ngɛ lae ke, <verse eid="REV 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />“Wa Nutsɔ kɛ wa Mawu, mo ji nɔ nɛ e sa nɛ a ngɔ anunyami kɛ agbo jemi kɛ he wami kɛ ha. Ejakaa mo nɛ o bɔ nihi kulaa, nɛ o suɔmi nya nɛ o bɔ mɛ ngɛ nɛ a ngɛ.”<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s1">Tobi ɔ kɛ womi kpo ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Nɛ i na womi kpo ko ngɛ nɔ nɛ hii si ngɛ matsɛ sɛ ɔ nɔ ɔ hiɔ nine mi. A ngma ni ngɛ womi ɔ mi kɛ e se tsuo, nɛ a sɔu e nya kɛ nya sɔumi níhi kpaago. <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Nɛ i na Mawu bɔfo ngua ko nɛ ngɛ ngmlaa kpae ke, “Mɛnɔ ji nɔ nɛ e sa kaa e tsɔ womi nɛ ɔ nya sɔumi ni ɔmɛ, nɛ e bli mi?” <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Se nɔ ko nɔ ko be Hiɔwe loo zugba a nɔ loo ni gbogboe ɔmɛ a kpɛti nɛ ma nyɛ bli womi ɔ nya nɛ e maa hyɛ mi.<verse eid="REV 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Nɛ i fo ya saminya, ejakaa a nɛ nɔ ko nɛ e sa nɛ e ma bli womi ɔ nya nɛ e hyɛ mi. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Kɛkɛ nɛ nikɔtɔma amɛ a ti nɔ kake de mi ke, “Ko fo ya! Hyɛ, Jata a nɛ je Yuda wɛtso ɔ mi ɔ, nɔ nɛ ji David bibimibibi ɔ ye kunimi. Lɛ ji nɔ nɛ ma nyɛ tsɔ womi ɔ nya sɔumi ni kpaago ɔmɛ nɛ e bli nya.”<verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Nɛ i na Tobi ko kaa nɔ nɛ a gbe lɛ. E daa si ngɛ matsɛ sɛ ɔ kɛ hɛ kali ɔmɛ a kpɛti. Nɛ nikɔtɔmahi nyingmi enyɔ kɛ eywiɛ ɔ bɔle lɛ kɛ kpe. Tobi ɔ ngɛ koli kpaago kɛ hɛ ngmɛ kpaago nɛ tsɔɔ Mawu Mumi kpaago ɔmɛ nɛ a tsɔ kɛ mane je ɔ tsuo ɔ. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />E ba, nɛ e ba ngɔ womi kpo ɔ ngɛ nɔ nɛ hii si ngɛ matsɛ sɛ ɔ nɔ ɔ hiɔ nine mi. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Benɛ e ngɛ womi ɔ hee ɔ, hɛ kali eywiɛ ɔmɛ kɛ nikɔtɔmahi nyingmi enyɔ kɛ eywiɛ ɔ kpla si ngɛ e hɛ mi. A ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ hɛɛ kpa saku kɛ sika tsu tɔhi nɛ a hyi tɔtɔɔtɔ kɛ la su ku womi tsopa. Enɛ ɔmɛ ji he tsɔli ɔmɛ a sɔlemi ɔmɛ.<verse eid="REV 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Nɛ a ngɛ la he ko lae ke, “Mo nɛ e sa kaa o he womi kpo ɔ, nɛ o tsɔ e nya sɔumi ni ɔmɛ nɛ o bli nya, ejakaa a gbe mo. Nɛ o kɛ o muɔ ɔ kpɔ nɔ fɛɛ nɔ kɛ ha Mawu, kɛ je wɛtso fɛɛ wɛtso kɛ ma tsuaa ma mi. <verse eid="REV 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />Nɛ o to matsɛ yemi kɛ osɔfo yemi kɛ ha mɛ nɛ a sɔmɔ wa Mawu ɔ nɛ a ye matsɛ ngɛ zugba a nɔ.”<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Nɛ i na bɔfohi akpeakpe abɔ ngɛ ye ni nami ɔ mi. A bɔle matsɛ sɛ ɔ kɛ hɛ kali ɔmɛ kɛ nikɔtɔma amɛ. A ngɛ lae wawɛɛ ke, <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />“Tobi ɔ nɛ a gbe ɔ, e sa nɛ a ngɔ he wami kɛ ni nami kɛ nile kɛ nyɛmi kɛ agbo jemi kɛ anunyami kɛ gbaami kɛ ha lɛ.”<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Nɛ i nu nibɔ ni ɔmɛ kulaa nɛ ngɛ hiɔwe kɛ zugba a nɔ kɛ zugba a sisi kɛ wo mi ɔ a he nɛ a ngɛ ngmlaa kpae ke, “Nɔ nɛ hii si ngɛ matsɛ sɛ ɔ nɔ kɛ Tobi ɔ nɔ́ ji gbaami kɛ agbo jemi kɛ anunyami kɛ he wami kɛ je neneene kɛ ya neneene.” <verse eid="REV 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Nɛ he kali eywiɛ ɔmɛ ke, “Amen!” Nɛ nikɔtɔmahi nyingmi enyɔ kɛ eywiɛ ɔmɛ kpla si nɛ a ja lɛ.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ni nami nɛ kɔɔ okpɔngɔhi a he</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Nɛ i na nɛ Tobi ɔ tsɔ womi ɔ nya sɔumi níhi kpaago ɔmɛ a kekle nɔ́ ɔ, nɛ i nu nɛ hɛ kali eywiɛ ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake ke kaa Hiɔwe simi ke, “Ba!”<verse eid="REV 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Jehanɛ ɔ i na okpɔngɔ hiɔ ko. Nɔ nɛ hii si ngɛ nɔ ɔ hɛɛ kɛɛ, nɛ a bu lɛ jlasi. E je kpo kaa kunimi yelɔ nɛ yaa nɛ e ya ye kunimi.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Benɛ Tobi ɔ tsɔ nya sɔumi nɔ́ nɛ ji enyɔ ɔ nya a, i nu nɛ hɛ kalɔ enyɔne ɔ de ke, “Ba!”<verse eid="REV 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Jehanɛ ɔ okpɔngɔ tsutsu ko je kpo, nɛ a ha e nɔ hilɔ ɔ he wami kɛ klaate agbo ko nɛ e kɛ je he jɔmi kɛ je zugba a nɔ, nɛ basabasa nɛ ba, nɛ nimli a gbe a he.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Benɛ Tobi ɔ tsɔ nya sɔumi nɔ́ nɛ ji etɛ ɔ nya a, i nu nɛ hɛ kalɔ nɛ ji etɛ ɔ de ke, “Ba!” Kɛkɛ nɛ i na okpɔngɔ yumu ko. Nɔ nɛ hii si ngɛ nɔ ɔ hɛɛ nɔ́ ngmɛmi nɔ́ ngɛ e dɛ mi. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Nɛ i nu gbi ko ngɛ hɛ kali eywiɛ ɔmɛ a kpɛti ke, “Ligbi kake hiɔwo nɛ e pee blɛfo tsesi kake, nɛ akoko tsesi etɛ hu nɛ e pee ligbi kake hiɔwo; se nu kɛ wai lɛɛ a ko ta he!”<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Benɛ Tobi ɔ tsɔ nya sɔumi nɔ́ eywiɛne ɔ nya a, i nu hɛ kalɔ nɛ ji eywiɛ ɔ gbi ke, “Ba!” <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />I na okpɔngɔ ko nɛ hɛɛ la zu su nɛ he mi kpa. Nɔ nɛ hii si ngɛ e nɔ ɔ biɛ ji Gbenɔ. Nɛ okpɔngɔ kpa ko hu nɛ Gbeje hii si ngɛ e nɔ ɔ nyɛɛ e se. Nɛ a ngɔ zugba a mi dlami eywiɛ mi kake kɛ ha mɛ kaa a kpata e hɛ mi kɛ klaate kɛ hwɔ kɛ gbenɔ hiɔ kɛ lohwe awi yeli.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e tsɔ nya sɔumi nɔ́ enuɔne ɔ nya. Nɛ i na nihi nɛ a gbe ngɛ Mawu munyu ɔ fiɛmi kɛ anɔkuale odase nɛ a ye ɔ he ɔ, a klaahi ngɛ bɔ sami la tɛ ɔ sisi. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Nɛ a kpa ngmlaa wawɛɛ ke, “Oo Nutsɔ, mo Matsɛ Klɔuklɔu kɛ Anɔkualetsɛ, mɛni be nɛ o maa kojo nɛ o maa gbla zugba a nɔ bimɛ nɛ gbe wɔ ɔmɛ a tue?” <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Kɛkɛ nɛ a ha a ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ tade hiɔ. Nɛ a de mɛ ke a jɔɔ a he be bɔɔ kɛ ya si be nɛ a maa gbe a nyɛmi ɔmɛ nɛ ji Yesu sɔmɔli ɔmɛ ta, kaa bɔ nɛ mɛ hu a gbe mɛ ɔ.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Benɛ Tobi ɔ tsɔ nya sɔumi nɔ́ nɛ ji ekpa a nya a, i na nɛ zugba hoso wawɛɛ, pu wo diblii kpii, nɛ hlami tsuɔ kaa muɔ. <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />Nɛ dodoehi tsɔ ba nɔ si kaa bɔ nɛ tso yiblii ngmlikiti wɔleɔ kɛ pueɔ si ke kɔɔhiɔ ngua ko fia a. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Nɛ hiɔwe ho se ya kaa womi kpo nɛ a hluɛ; nɛ yoku kɛ wo kpɔ tsuo hia kɛ je a blɔ he.<verse eid="REV 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Kɛkɛ nɛ zugba a nɔ matsɛ ɔmɛ kɛ nimli ngua amɛ, tatsɛ ngua amɛ, niatsɛ ɔmɛ kɛ he wali ɔmɛ, nyɔguɛ ɔmɛ, odehe ɔmɛ kɛ nɔ fɛɛ nɔ ya laa a he ngɛ tɛ muɔhi a mi kɛ tɛhi a sisi ngɛ yokuhi a nɔ. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />Nɛ a de yoku ɔmɛ kɛ tɛ sa amɛ ke, “Nyɛ ba ha wa nɔ nɛ waa laa wa he kɛ je nɔ nɛ hii si ngɛ matsɛ sɛ ɔ nɔ kɛ Tobi ɔ abofu ɔ nya. <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />Ejakaa a mi mi fumi ligbi ngua a su, nɛ mɛnɔ ma nyɛ nya maa da?”<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s1">Nihi nɛ sɔmɔ Mawu ngɛ anɔkuale mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, i na Mawu bɔfohi eywiɛ nɛ daa si ngɛ zugba kɔ nya eywiɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ, nɛ a tsi kɔɔhiɔ eywiɛ ɔmɛ a nya bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a ko fia ngɛ zugba a nɔ loo wo ɔ nɔ loo tso ko nɔ. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Nɛ i na Mawu bɔfo kpa ko hu nɛ je pu site he kɛ ma, nɛ e hɛɛ Mawu hɛ kalɔ ɔ e nɔ́ nya sɔumi nɔ́ ɔ. Nɛ e kpa ngmlaa wawɛɛ kɛ de bɔfo eywiɛ ɔmɛ nɛ Mawu ha mɛ he wami kaa a puɛ zugba a kɛ wo ɔ ke, <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />“Nyɛ ko puɛ zugba a loo wo ɔ loo tso ɔmɛ kɛ ya si be nɛ waa kɛ nya sɔumi nɔ́ ma kadi wa Mawu ɔ sɔmɔli ɔmɛ a hɛ nya.”<verse eid="REV 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Nɛ a tsɔɔ mi ni nɛmɛ nɛ a kɛ Mawu nya sɔumi nɔ́ ɔ kadi mɛ ɔ a yi bɔ; nimli akpe lafa nyingmi eywiɛ kɛ eywiɛ nɛ je Israel wɛtso nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ ɔmɛ a mi.<verse eid="REV 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />Nimli nɛ je Yuda wɛtso ɔ mi nɛ a kɛ nya sɔumi nɔ́ ɔ kadi mɛ ɔ, a yi bɔ ji akpe nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:5">Ruben wɛtso ɔ mi ɔ, nimli akpe nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:5">Gad wɛtso ɔ mi ɔ, nimli akpe nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ;<verse eid="REV 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />Aser wɛtso ɔ mi ɔ, nimli akpe nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:6">Naftali wɛtso ɔ mi ɔ, nimli akpe nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:6">Manase wɛtso ɔ mi ɔ, nimli akpe nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ;<verse eid="REV 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />Simeon wɛtso ɔ mi ɔ, nimli akpe nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:7">Levi wɛtso ɔ mi ɔ, nimli akpe nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:7">Isaka wɛtso ɔ mi ɔ, nimli akpe nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ;<verse eid="REV 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />Zebulon wɛtso ɔ mi ɔ, nimli akpe nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:8">Yosef wɛtso ɔ mi ɔ, nimli akpe nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:8">nɛ Benyamin wɛtso ɔ hu nimli akpe nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, i na nimli asafo babauu nɛ nɔ ko be nyɛe maa kane. Nimli nɛ ɔmɛ je je ɔ mi he fɛɛ he, kɛ ma fɛɛ ma nɔ kɛ wɛtso fɛɛ wɛtso mi nɛ a daa si ngɛ matsɛ sɛ ɔ kɛ Tobi ɔ hɛ mi. A wo tade hiɔ nɛ a hɛɛ tã bahi ngɛ a dɛ mi. <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />A ngɛ ngmlaa kpae wawɛɛ ke, “Wa yi wami hemi jee wa Mawu ɔ nɛ hii si ngɛ matsɛ sɛ ɔ nɔ ɔ, kɛ Tobi ɔ dɛ mi!” <verse eid="REV 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Bɔfo ɔmɛ tsuo daa si kɛ bɔle matsɛ sɛ ɔ kɛ nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ hɛ kali eywiɛ ɔmɛ. A ngɔ a hɛ mi kɛ bu si ngɛ matsɛ sɛ ɔ hɛ mi nɛ a ngɛ Mawu jae nɛ a ngɛ dee ke, <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />“Amen! A ngɔ yi jemi kɛ anunyami kɛ nile kɛ sina kɛ agbo jemi kɛ he wami kɛ ha wa Mawu ɔ kɛ je neneene kɛ ya neneene. Amen!”<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Kɛkɛ nɛ nikɔtɔma amɛ a ti nɔ kake bi mi ke, “Ni nɛmɛ nɛ wo tade hiɔ nɛ ɔ, mɛnɔmɛ i, nɛ jije a je?”<verse eid="REV 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Nɛ i ha heto ke, “Ye Nutsɔ, i li. I kpa mo pɛɛ nɛ o tsɔɔ mi.” E ha mi heto ke, “Mɛ ji nihi nɛ je nɔ́ nami agbo ɔ mi, nɛ a fɔ a tade ɔmɛ a he ngɛ Tobi ɔ muɔ ɔ mi, nɛ tade ɔmɛ hiɔ futafuta. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Enɛ ɔ he je nɛ a ngɛ Mawu matsɛ sɛ ɔ hɛ mi nɛ a ngɛ lɛ sɔmɔe nyɔ kɛ pia ngɛ e Sɔlemi We ɔ nɛ. Nɔ nɛ hii si ngɛ matsɛ sɛ ɔ nɔ ɔ, e kɛ mɛ maa hi si nɛ e maa bu a he. <verse eid="REV 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />Hwɔ be mɛ yee, nɛ kuma hu be mɛ tɔe. Jehanɛ ɔ, pu be mɛ saae, nɛ latsa hu be mɛ tsae gblee. <verse eid="REV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />Ejakaa Tobi ɔ nɛ daa si ngɛ matsɛ sɛ ɔ hɛ mi ɔ maa bu a he. E ma kpaka mɛ kɛ ya he nɛ wami nyu ngɛ, nɛ Mawu ma tsu a hɛ mi vo nyu tsuo.”<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Benɛ Tobi ɔ tsɔ nya sɔumi nɔ́ kpaagone ɔ nya a, hiɔwe jɔ dii maa pee ngmlɛfia fa. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Nɛ i na bɔfo kpaago ɔmɛ nɛ daa si ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi ɔ; nɛ a ha mɛ tɛtlɛmatlɛhi kpaago.<verse eid="REV 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Nɛ bɔfo kpa ko nɛ hɛɛ la su ku womi tsopa tɔ nɛ a kɛ sika tsu pee ɔ ba da si ngɛ bɔ sami la tɛ ɔ he. A ha lɛ la su ku womi tsopa fuu nɛ e sa kɛ piɛ klɔuklɔu bi ɔmɛ kulaa a sɔlemi ɔmɛ a he ngɛ sika bɔ sami la tɛ nɛ maa si ngɛ matsɛ sɛ ɔ hɛ mi ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Nɛ la su ku womi tsopa a he via a futu klɔuklɔu bi ɔmɛ a sɔlemi ɔ kɛ je bɔfo ɔ ngɔ kɛ ho Mawu hɛ mi ya.<verse eid="REV 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Kɛkɛ nɛ hiɔwe bɔfo ɔ je la ngɛ bɔ sami la tɛ ɔ mi kɛ wo la su ku womi tsopa tɔ ɔ mi nɛ e sake lɛ kɛ fɔ zugba a nɔ. Nɛ Hiɔwe si, nɛ oslabai gba, nɛ zugba hoso.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Kɛkɛ nɛ hiɔwe bɔfohi kpaago nɛ hɛɛ tɛtlɛmatlɛhi kpaago ɔmɛ dla a he nɛ a kpa bɛ ɔmɛ.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Kekle bɔfo ɔ kpa e bɛ ɔ, nɛ hiɔmi tɛ kɛ la nɛ muɔ futu mi je hiɔwe kɛ ba pue zugba a nɔ. Zugba a mi dlami etɛ mi kake sa, nɛ tsohi tsuo a mi dlami etɛ mi kake ke ngahi kulaa ngla.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Nɛ bɔfo nɛ ji enyɔ ɔ kpa e tɛtlɛmatlɛ ɔ, nɛ a sake nɔ́ ko nɛ ngɛ kaa yoku ngua ko nɛ ngɛ tsoe kɛ fɔ wo ɔ mi. Kɛkɛ nɛ wo ɔ mi dlami etɛ mi kake plɛ muɔ. <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />Nɛ wo ɔ mi nihi nɛ ngɛ wami ɔ a mi dlami etɛ mi kake gbo, nɛ lɛhi hu a mi dlami etɛ mi kake hɛ mi kpata.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Nɛ bɔfo nɛ ji etɛ ɔ kpa e tɛtlɛmatlɛ ɔ, nɛ dodoe agbo ko nɛ ngɛ tsoe kaa kane tsɔ kɛ je hiɔwe kɛ ba nɔ pa amɛ kɛ hehi nɛ nyu baa ngɛ ɔmɛ a mi dlami etɛ mi kake mi. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />Dodoe ɔ biɛ ji Doomi, ejakaa e ha nɛ nyu ɔmɛ a mi dlami etɛ mi kake duɔ, nɛ nihi fuu nɛ nu ɔ a gbo.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Nɛ bɔfo nɛ ji eywiɛ ɔ kpa e bɛ ɔ. Kɛkɛ nɛ a fia pu ɔ mi dlami etɛ mi kake kɛ nyɔhiɔ mi dlami etɛ mi kake kɛ dodoe ɔmɛ a mi dlami etɛ mi kake ní, nɛ a mi dlami etɛ mi kakaaka a wo diblii kpii, nɛ pu ɔ mi dlami etɛ mi kake mi tsɔ we, nɛ nyɔhiɔ kɛ dodoe ɔmɛ hu ja a kɛ.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Nɛ i na kɔle ko nɛ ngɛ tee ngɛ hiɔwe lokoo nɛ e ngɛ ngmlaa kpae ke, “Due, due, due, ha nimli ngɛ zugba a nɔ, ngɛ níhi nɛ maa ba a nɔ ɔ, ke bɔfohi etɛ nɛ piɛ ɔmɛ kpa a tɛtlɛmatlɛ ɔmɛ!”<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="s1">Muɔ voo ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Kɛkɛ nɛ bɔfo nɛ ji enuɔ ɔ kpa e bliigo ɔ, nɛ i na dodoe nɛ tsɔ kɛ je hiɔwe kɛ ba nɔ zugba. Nɛ a ngɔ muɔ voo nɛ a nɛ e sisi ɔ nya safie ɔ kɛ ha lɛ.<verse eid="REV 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Benɛ dodoe ɔ bli muɔ ɔ nya a, la su ku kpii nɛ ngɛ kaa flɔɔnɔɔ ngua mi la su ku je mi kɛ je kpo. Nɛ la su ku ɔ wo diblii bɔ nɛ a nɛ pu kɛ kɔɔhiɔ fiami.<verse eid="REV 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Kɛkɛ nɛ baalɛhi je la su ku ɔ mi kɛ ba hyi zugba a nɔ, nɛ a ha mɛ he wami nɛ a kɛ tsiɛ nɔ kaa nyingmogblakoto. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />A de mɛ kaa a ko kpata nga loo tsohi a hɛ mi. Se mohu a ya ye nimli nɛ Mawu okadi ɔ be a hɛ nya a awi. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />A ko gbe mɛ, se a pi mɛ hlami enuɔ, nɛ a na nɔ́ kaa bɔ nɛ ke nyingmogblakoto tsiɛ nɔ nɛ e peeɔ lɛ ɔ. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Jamɛ a be ɔmɛ a mi ɔ,nimli ma hla kaa a gbe a he, se a be gbenɔ nae nɛ a gbo. A maa suɔ nɛ a gbo se gbenɔ maa ma a nya fo!<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Baalɛ ɔmɛ ngɛ kaa okpɔngɔhi nɛ a wlua mɛ kɛ ha ta. A bu ní komɛ nɛ ngɛ kaa sika tsu akekleehi ngɛ a yi. Nɛ a hɛ mi je nimli a hɛ mi. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />A he bwɔmi ka kaa yo yi bwɔmi, nɛ a lungu ngɛ kaa jata lungu. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />A he toto ngɛ kaa dade dama, nɛ a pɛlihi a mi ngɛ pɛe kaa trɔkehi nɛ a ngɛ gblae kɛ yaa ta.<verse eid="REV 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />A ngɛ kpi nɛ a tsiɛɛ nɔ kaa nyingmogblakoto. He wami ngɛ a kpi ɔ mi nɛ ke a tsiɛ nɔ ko ɔ, e yee lɛ hlami enuɔ. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />A matsɛ ji muɔ voo ɔ bɔfo. E biɛ ngɛ Hebri gbi mi ji Abadon, nɛ Hela gbi mi ɔ, a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Apolion. E sisi ji hɛ mi kpatalɔ.<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Kekle haomi ɔ ba be, nɛ e piɛ enyɔ nɛ maa ba.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɔfo nɔ́ puɛli eywiɛ amɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Bɔfo nɛ ji ekpa a kpa e bliigo ɔ, nɛ i nu gbi ko kɛ je sika tsu afɔle sami la tɛ ɔ koli eywiɛ ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ Mawu matsɛ yemi sɛ ɔ hɛ mi ɔ mi. <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />Nɛ e ngɛ bɔfo nɛ ji ekpa nɛ hɛɛ bliigo ɔ dee ke, “Moo ngmɛɛ bɔfohi eywiɛ ɔmɛ nɛ a fi mɛ ngɛ Yufrate pa ngua a nya a a he.” <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a pine bɔfohi eywiɛ ɔmɛ nɛ a dla kɛ to ngmlɛfia a, kɛ ligbi ɔ, kɛ hlami kɛ jeha a, konɛ a gbe nimli tsuo a mi dlami etɛ mi kake. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Nɛ a hɛɛ ta hwuli kpanakuhi akpeakpe lafa enyɔ. I nu nɛ a tsɔɔ a hiɛmi.<verse eid="REV 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />I na a okpɔngɔ ɔmɛ ngɛ ye nina a mi. A nɔ hili ɔmɛ wo damahi nɛ a su ngɛ kaa la kɛ bluu kɛ kungwɔ zɔ. Nɛ okpɔngɔ ɔmɛ a yi ngɛ kaa jata yi, nɛ la kɛ la su ku kɛ nɔ́ ko nɛ a tsɛɛ ke sɔlfa a ngɛ a nya mi jee. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Hɛ mi kpatami nihi etɛ, nɛ ji la kɛ la su ku kɛ sɔlfa nɛ ngɛ a nya mi jee ɔ gbe nimli a mi gbami etɛ mi kake. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Ejakaa okpɔngɔ ɔmɛ a he wami ngɛ a nya mi kɛ a hlemi ɔmɛ a mi. Yi ngɛ a hlemi ɔmɛ a nya kaa sinɔhi a ní, nɛ a kɛ yeɔ nɔ awi.<verse eid="REV 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Se nihi nɛ gbo we ngɛ hɛ mi kpatami nɛ ɔmɛ a se ɔ, a kua Mawu sɔmɔmi kɛ sa! A ngmɛɛ we a wɔ ɔmɛ a jami he, aloo a amaga amɛ nɛ a pee kɛ sika tsu kɛ sika hiɔ, akɔblee kɛ tɛ, kɛ tso, nɛ ji níhi nɛ hyɛ we ní, nɛ a nui ní, nɛ a nyɛɛ we hulɔ ɔ. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />Nɛ a tsakee we a tsui kɛ a je mi bami ngɛ a nɔ gbemi kɛ aze ni tsumi ɔmɛ kɛ ajuama bɔmi kɛ jumi he.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s1">Mawu blɔ nya tomi ɔ ba mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Jehanɛ ɔ, i na bɔfo ngua kpa ko hulɔ nɛ ngɛ si kplee kɛ je hiɔwe. Bɔ kuu bɔle e he nɛ alale ngɛ e yi mi. E hɛ mi ngɛ kpɛe kaa pu, nɛ e nanehi a he ngɛ la pae.<verse eid="REV 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />E hɛɛ womi kpo wayo ko nɛ a bli mi ngɛ e dɛ mi. E ngɔ e hiɔ nane kɛ ma wo ɔ nɔ, nɛ e kɛ e muɔ nane ɔ hu ma zugba. <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />E kpa ngmlaa wawɛɛ, nɛ e gbi pɛ kaa jata. Kɛkɛ nɛ hiɔwe simi kpaago ɔmɛ wo gbi.<verse eid="REV 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Jinɛ i yaa ngma nɔ́ nɛ hiɔwe simi kpaago ɔmɛ de ɔ, se gbi ko je Hiɔwe de mi ke, “Koo ngma. E sɛ kaa a munyu ɔmɛ a je kpo!”<verse eid="REV 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Kɛkɛ nɛ bɔfo ngua a nɛ daa si ngɛ wo kɛ zugba nɔ ɔ wo e hiɔ nine nɔ kɛ ho hiɔwe ya. <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />Nɛ e kã nɔ nɛ ngɛ daa kɛ daa a kita, nɔ nɛ bɔ hiɔwe kɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ngɛ e mi ɔ, kɛ zugba kɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ngɛ e nɔ ɔ, kɛ wo kɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ngɛ e mi ɔ; ke a ko puɛ be hu. <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />Se ke bɔfo kpaagone ɔ kpa e bliigo ɔ pɛ a maa gbe Mawu laami blɔ nya tomi ɔ nya, kaa bɔ nɛ e de lɛ nitsɛ e tsɔli nɛ ji gbali ɔmɛ ɔ. <verse eid="REV 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Kɛkɛ nɛ gbi nɛ je hiɔwe ɔ tu mi munyu ekohu ke, “Yaa nɛ o ya he womi kpo nɛ a bli mi ngɛ bɔfo ɔ nɛ daa si ngɛ wo kɛ zugba nɔ ɔ dɛ mi ɔ.”<verse eid="REV 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, i ya na lɛ nɛ i de lɛ ke e ngɔ womi ɔ kɛ ha mi. Nɛ e de mi ke, “Mo he nɛ o ye. E maa ngɔ ngɛ o nya mi kaa hwo. Se ke o mi lɛ ɔ, e maa duɔ ngɛ o mi mi!” <verse eid="REV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Kɛkɛ nɛ i ngɔ womi kpo wayo ɔ ngɛ bɔfo ɔ dɛ mi nɛ i ye. Nɛ kaa bɔ nɛ e de pɛpɛɛpɛ ɔ, e ngɔ ngɛ ye nya mi kaa hwo, se benɛ i mi lɛ ɔ, ye muklii mi kɔɔ mi.<verse eid="REV 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Nɛ e de mi ke, “E sa nɛ o gba ekohu ngɛ nimli fuu kɛ mahi kɛ wɛtsohi kɛ matsɛmɛ a he.”<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s1">Mawu gbali ɔmɛ nɛ a gbe ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Jehanɛ ɔ, a ha mi nɔ́ susumi tso, nɛ a de mi ke, “Yaa nɛ o ya susu Mawu Sɔlemi We ɔ, kɛ he nɛ afɔle sami la tɛ ɔ ngɛ ɔ, nɛ o kane sɔmɔli ɔmɛ a yi bɔ. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Se o ko susu kpo ɔ nɛ ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ mi ɔ, ejakaa a ngɔ kɛ ha ma amɛ, nɛ maa naa Ma Klɔuklɔu ɔ hlami nyingmi eywiɛ kɛ enyɔ. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Nɛ i ma ngɔ he wami kɛ ha ye he odase yeli enyɔ ɔmɛ. A ma bu kpekpe nɛ a maa gba ligbi akpe kake kɛ lafa enyɔ kɛ nyingmi ekpa.”<verse eid="REV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Kikɛmɛ a gbali enyɔ nɛ ɔmɛ ji nu tsohi enyɔ kɛ kane tsohi enyɔ ɔmɛ nɛ maa si ngɛ zugba a tsuo a Mawu ɔ hɛ mi ɔ. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ maa ka kaa e maa ye mɛ awi ɔ, la maa tso kɛ je a nya mi nɛ e maa gbe lɛ. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />A ngɛ he wami nɛ a ma nga hiɔwe nya nɛ hiɔmi be nɛe ngɛ jamɛ a jeha etɛ kɛ fa a mi benɛ a ngɛ gbae ɔ. Nɛ a ma nyɛ ha nɛ pa amɛ kɛ wo ɔmɛ ma plɛ muɔ, nɛ a ma ha nɛ a ja eko fɛɛ eko maa ba zugba a nɔ be tsuaa be nɛ a suɔ.<verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Ke a ye odase ɔ jeha etɛ kɛ fa a gbe nya a, lohwe ɔ nɛ maa je kpo kɛ je muɔ voo nɛ a nɛ e sisi ɔ mi ɔ, e ma je ta kɛ wo mɛ. E maa ye a nɔ nɛ e ma kpata a hɛ mi. <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />A gbogboehi ma pue si ngɛ Yerusalem gbɛjegbɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ, ma ngua nɛ a tsɛɛ ngɛ mumi mi ke Sodom loo Mizraim ɔ, he nɛ a sɛu a Nutsɔ ɔ ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />A ma si mɛ kɛ fɔ si ligbi etɛ kɛ fa, nɛ a be hae nɛ nɔ ko maa pu mɛ. Nɛ nihi maa je mahi a nɔ kɛ ba hyɛ mɛ. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Jamɛ a be ɔ maa pee nyami ligbi kɛ ha je ɔ tsuo. A bua maa jɔ a he nɛ a maa ke a he ni, nɛ a ma tsɛ ni yemi kɛ ni numi kpehi nɛ a kɛ nya ngɛ gbali enyɔ nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ hao mɛ saminya a a gbenɔ ɔ he.<verse eid="REV 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Se ligbi etɛ kɛ fa a se ɔ, wami mumi nɛ je Mawu ngɔ maa ba a mi nɛ a maa te si. Gbeye maa nu nɔ tsuaa nɔ wawɛɛ. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Kɛkɛ ɔ, gbi ngua ko maa pɛ kɛ je hiɔwe ke, “Nyɛɛ ba hiɛ ɔ!” A maa te si ngɛ a he nyɛli ɔmɛ a hɛ mi kɛ ho hiɔwe ya ngɛ bɔ kuu mi.<verse eid="REV 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Jamɛ a ngmlɛfia a nɔ nɔuu ɔ, zugba ma mimiɛ wawɛɛ nɛ ma a mi gbami nyɔngma mi kake hɛ mi ma kpata; nɛ nimli akpe kpaago ma gbo. Nihi nɛ piɛ ɔmɛ maa ye gbeye nɛ a maa ngɔ anunyami kɛ ha Hiɔwe Mawu ɔ.<verse eid="REV 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Aywilɛho enyɔne ɔ ba be, nɛ nɔ́ nɛ ji etɛ ɔ nyɛɛ se nɔuu.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Kɛkɛ nɛ bɔfo nɛ ji kpaago ɔ kpa e bliigo ɔ, nɛ gbihi nɛ nya wa pɛ ngɛ hiɔwe ke: “Jehanɛ ɔ je nɛ ɔ mi matsɛ yemi ɔ peeɔ wa Nutsɔ ɔ kɛ e Kristo ɔ nɔ́; nɛ e maa ye matsɛ kɛ ya neneene.”<verse eid="REV 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Nɛ Nikɔtɔmahi nyingmi enyɔ kɛ eywiɛ nɛ hii si ngɛ a matsɛ sɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi ɔ kpla si nɛ a ja lɛ ke, <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />“Wa ngɛ mo si nae, wa Nutsɔ Mawu Ope, mo nɔ nɛ o ngɛ, nɛ o hi si hyɛ. Ejakaa amlɔ nɛ ɔ, o ngɔ o he wami nɛ kle ɔ nɛ o bɔni matsɛ yemi. <verse eid="REV 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Majemaje li ɔmɛ a mi mi fu mo, se amlɔ nɛ ɔ mo hu o mi mi ma fu mɛ. Be ɔ su, nɛ o maa kojo ni gbogboe ɔmɛ, nɛ o maa wo o sɔmɔli nɛ ji o gbali kɛ ni klɔuklɔu ɔmɛ, kɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ yee mo gbeye ɔ hiɔ, nimli nguahi kɛ nimli nyafii ɔmɛ tsuo. Nɛ o ma kpata nihi nɛ puɛ zugba a a hɛ mi.”<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Kɛkɛ nɛ a bli Mawu sɔlemi tsu ɔ nya ngɛ hiɔwe, nɛ o maa na e somi daka a ngɛ mi. Hiɔwe pa la, nɛ e si; nɛ hiɔmi tɛ nɛ wawɛɛ. Zugba mimiɛ nɛ je ɔ hoso.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yo ɔ kɛ e bi ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Nɛ nyakpɛ nɔ agbo ko je kpo ngɛ hiɔwe nɛ tsɔɔ níhi nɛ maa ba. I na yo ko nɛ pu ha e he, nɛ nyɔhiɔ ngɛ e nane sisi, kɛ dodoehi nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ nɛ a kɛ pee jlasi kɛ fi e yi. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />E mi mi wa nɛ e nu kɔɔmi kɛ ngmlaa.<verse eid="REV 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Tlukaa a, Gbeye Lohwe tsutsu agbo ko ba je kpo, kɛ e yihi kpaago, kɛ kolihi nyɔngma; nɛ e bu matsɛ pɛɛhi kpaago ngɛ e yi ɔmɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />E hlemi ɔ gbla hiɔwe dodoe ɔmɛ kulaa a mi gbami etɛ mi kake, nɛ e ngmɛɛ a he kɛ mane zugba. E ya da si ngɛ yo ɔ nɛ miɔ nɛ e ma fɔ ɔ hɛ mi. Nɛ e pee klaalo nɛ ke e fɔ pɛ nɛ e ye bi ɔ. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />E fɔ binyumuyo, nɔ nɛ maa ye je ɔ tsuo nɔ kɛ nine si wami. Se a ngɔ jokuɛ ɔ kɛ ho Mawu kɛ e matsɛ sɛ ɔ he ya tɛɛ. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Kɛkɛ nɛ yo ɔ tu fo kɛ ho nga nɔ he ko ya, he nɛ Mawu dla kɛ to lɛ nɛ e maa hyɛ e nɔ ngɛ kɛ ya si ligbi akpe kɛ lafa enyɔ kɛ nyingmi ekpa.<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Nɛ ta te si ngɛ hiɔwe; Bɔfo Mikael kɛ bɔfohi nɛ ngɛ e sisi ɔ hwu kɛ si Gbeye Lohwe ɔ kɛ bɔfohi nɛ gbee si nɛ a ngɛ lɛ hu e sisi ɔ. <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />A ye Gbeye Lohwe ɔ nɔ nɛ a fie lɛ kɛ je hiɔwe. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Gbeye Lohwe nɛ ɔ ji blema sinɔ ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Abosiami ɔ, nɛ lɛ ji nɔ nɛ ngɛ je ɔ tsuo sisie ɔ nɛ. A fie lɛ kɛ e ta bi ɔmɛ tsuo kɛ ba zugba a nɔ.<verse eid="REV 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Kɛkɛ nɛ i nu ngmlaa wawɛɛ ko he ngɛ hiɔwe ke, “Yi wami hemi nɛ je Mawu ngɔ ɔ, kɛ he wami kɛ matsɛ yemi ɔ kɛ nɔ yemi he wami nɛ e Kristo ɔ hɛɛ ɔ ba su hiɛ ɔ jehanɛ ɔ. Ejakaa a fie wa nyɛmi ɔmɛ a Nyapolɔ ɔ kɛ je hiɔwe kɛ ho zugba a nɔ ya. E ngɛ a nya poe daa nyɔ kɛ pia kɛ ngɛ wa Mawu ɔ hae. <verse eid="REV 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />A kɛ Tobi ɔ muɔ kɛ a odase yemi ɔ ye e nɔ kunimi. Ejakaa a di we mɛ nitsɛmɛ a wami se, nɛ a ngɔ kɛ ha ngɛ e he. <verse eid="REV 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Oo hiɔwe ɔmɛ, kɛ nyɛ hiɔwe mi bimɛ, nyɛ nya! Nyɛ bua nɛ jɔ! Se nyɛ je ɔ mi bimɛ, kpoo ha nyɛ, Abosiami ɔ ba zugba a nɔ ngɛ nyɛ ngɔ kɛ mi mi fumi agbo, ejakaa e le kaa e be pi.”<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Benɛ Gbeye Lohwe ɔ na kaa a sake lɛ kɛ fɔ zugba a nɔ ɔ, e hao yo ɔ nɛ fɔ ɔ. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Se a ha yo ɔ pɛlihi konɛ e te kɛ ho nga nɔ ya, he nɛ a dla kɛ to lɛ nɛ a maa hyɛ e nɔ ngɛ, nɛ a maa bu e he kɛ je Gbeye Lohwe ɔ dɛ mi jeha etɛ kɛ fa a.<verse eid="REV 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Nɛ nyu babauu je Gbeye Lohwe ɔ nya mi kaa pa, nɛ e fo dɔ kɛ yaa na yo ɔ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ e ngɔ lɛ kɛ ho. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Se zugba a ye kɛ bua lɛ, ejakaa e bli e nya mi nɛ e mii nyu ɔ! <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Jehanɛ ɔ, Gbeye Lohwe ɔ nɛ e mi mi fu ɔ pue blɔ konɛ e ya tua yo ɔ bimɛ nɛ piɛ ɔ, nɛ ji nihi kulaa nɛ yeɔ Mawu mlaa amɛ a nɔ nɛ a deɔ ke Yesu nihi ji mɛ ɔ. <verse eid="REV 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />E daa si ngɛ mlɛe ngɛ wo kewu nɔ.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s1">Nyakpe níhi nɛ Gbeye Lohwe ɔ pee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Nɛ jehanɛ ɔ, ngɛ ye ni nami ɔ mi ɔ, i na nyakpɛ lohwe ko nɛ e je kpo kɛ je wo ɔ mi kɛ ma. E ngɛ yihi kpaago kɛ kolihi nyɔngma, nɛ matsɛ pɛɛhi nyɔngma ngɛ koli ɔmɛ a nɔ. A ngma musu bɔmi biɛhi ngɛ e yi ɔmɛ eko fɛɛ eko nɔ. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Lohwe nɛ ɔ ngɛ kaa ngatsɛ se e ngɛ osisibliisii nanehi, nɛ e nya ngɛ kaa jata nya. Gbeye Lohwe ɔ ngɔ lɛ nitsɛ e he wami kɛ e matsɛ sɛ kɛ nɔ yemi he blɔ agbo kɛ ha lɛ.<verse eid="REV 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />I na e yi ɔmɛ a kpɛti kake kaa nɔ nɛ a plaa lɛ wawɛɛ nɛ e be hie tsami, se pa nɛ e ko gbe lɛ ɔ gbo. Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nya kpɛ e he nɛ e nyɛɛ Lohwe ɔ se. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ ja Gbeye Lohwe ɔ, ejakaa e ngɔ e nɔ yemi he wami kɛ ha Lohwe ɔ nɛ je wo ɔ mi ɔ. Nɛ a ja Lohwe ɔ hulɔ, nɛ a de ke, “Mɛnɔ kle kaa lɛ? Mɛnɔ ma nyɛ nɛ e kɛ lɛ maa hwu ta?”<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Gbeye Lohwe ɔ wo Lohwe ɔ kã nɛ e de musu bɔmi ni nguahi kɛ si Nutsɔ ɔ. Nɛ e ha lɛ nɔ yemi he wami nɛ e ye zugba a nɔ kɛ ya si hlami nyingmi eywiɛ kɛ enyɔ. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, e pee musu bɔmi níhi kɛ si Mawu biɛ kɛ e Sɔlemi We ɔ, kɛ níhi kulaa nɛ ngɛ hiɔwe ɔ. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Gbeye Lohwe ɔ ha lɛ he wami nɛ e kɛ Mawu nimli ɔmɛ nɛ hwu ta nɛ e ye a nɔ, nɛ e ye ma amɛ kulaa kɛ gbi slɔɔto tuli ɔmɛ tsuo a nɔ matsɛ. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Nɛ adesahi tsuo nɛ a ngmɛ a biɛ ngɛ Tobi ɔ nɛ a gbe ɔ Wami Womi ɔ mi loko ji a bɔ je ɔ, a ja musu Lohwe ɔ.<verse eid="REV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />“Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ nuɔ nɔ́ ɔ, e bu tue saminya! <verse eid="REV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />Mawu nimli ɔmɛ nɛ a ngma kɛ fɔ si ha mɛ kaa a wo mɛ tsu ɔ, a maa nuu mɛ nɛ a maa ngɔ mɛ kɛ ho. Ni nɛmɛ nɛ a ngma kɛ fɔ si ha mɛ kaa a gbe mɛ ɔ, a maa gbe mɛ. Se nyɛ ko hao, ejakaa enɛ ɔ ji he blɔ kɛ ha nyɛ nɛ nyɛ ma kɛ na tsui si tomi kɛ hemi kɛ yemi.”<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Jehanɛ ɔ, i na nyakpɛ lohwe kpa ko nɛ je zu mi kɛ ma. E ngɛ koli tsɔwi enyɔ nɛ a ngɛ kaa jijɔ kolihi. Se e pɛmi ngɛ gbeye. E ngɛ kaa Gbeye Lohwe ɔ pɛmi. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Kekle Lohwe ɔ nɛ jinɛ e pa a ko gbe lɛ ɔ, e tsuɔ e nɔ yemi he wami ɔmɛ kulaa a he ni; nɛ e ha nɛ je ɔ tsuo jaa lɛ. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />E pee nyakpɛ ni nguahi, nɛ eko ji kaa e ha nɛ la je hiɔwe kɛ ba ngɛ nihi a hɛ mi. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Nɛ e gu nyakpɛ okadi peemi nɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ kɛ ngɛ nihi mlɔɔe ngɛ je ɔ mi he fɛɛ he. E peeɔ nyakpɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ benɛ kekle Lohwe ɔ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ nɛ e ngɛ lɛ hyɛe. Nɛ e ha nɛ je mi bi ɔmɛ puɛ amaga agbo ko nɛ je kekle Lohwe ɔ nɛ a plaa lɛ wawɛɛ se e yi na wami ɔ. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />A ha lɛ he blɔ nɛ e ngɔ mumi kɛ wo amaga nɛ ɔ mi konɛ e ha nɛ e tu munyu tete. Kɛkɛ nɛ amaga a fa kaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ kua ke e be lɛ jae ɔ, e sa gbenɔ!<verse eid="REV 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />E bi nɛ nɔmlɔ ngua kɛ nɔmlɔ wayo, sikatsɛ kɛ ohiafo, nyɔguɛ kɛ odehe tsuo ɔ, a kadi a ti nɔ fɛɛ nɔ ngɛ a hiɔ nine nɔ loo a hɛ nya. <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />Nɛ nɔ ko be nɛ e ma na ni tsumi aloo e ma he nɔ ko ngɛ tsuapo ko mi ke jamɛ a so ɔ loo yi bɔ nɛ daa si kɛ ha Lohwe ɔ biɛ ɔ be ehe. <verse eid="REV 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Nɔ́ ko nɛ e nya nami hia susumi saminya ji enɛ ɔ nɛ. Nihi nɛ ma nyɛ ɔ, a tsɔɔ nɔ́ nɛ ɔ nya. Moo ngɔ yi bɔ lafa ekpa kɛ nyingmi ekpa kɛ ekpa kɛ piɛ ningma okadihi abɔ nɛ peeɔ e biɛ ɔ he.<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s1">La he</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Jehanɛ ɔ, i na Tobi ɔ nɛ daa si ngɛ Zion Yoku ɔ nɔ ngɛ Yerusalem, nɛ nimli akpe lafa kɛ nyingmi eywiɛ kɛ eywiɛ nɛ a ngma a biɛ kɛ E Tsɛ biɛ ngɛ a hɛ nya a ngɛ e ngɔ. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Nɛ i nu pɛmi ko he kɛ je hiɔwe kaa nyu babauu nɛ ngɛ si puee aloo kaa hiɔwe simi ngua ko. Sɔlemi lali nɛ ngɛ lae, nɛ a ngɛ saku hu fiae ɔ a gbi nɛ i nu ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="REV 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Lali babauu akpe kɛ lafa nyingmi eywiɛ kɛ eywiɛ ɔmɛ ngɛ nyakpɛ la he ko lae ngɛ Mawu matsɛ sɛ ɔ kɛ hɛ kali eywiɛ ɔmɛ kɛ nikɔtɔmahi nyingmi enyɔ kɛ eywiɛ ɔmɛ a hɛ mi. Nɔ ko be nɛ ma nyɛ la nɛ ɔ ma la, ja nihi akpe kɛ lafa eywiɛ kɛ eywiɛ ɔmɛ nɛ a kpɔ mɛ kɛ je zugba a nɔ ɔ pɛ. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Ejakaa a hɛɛ a he klɔuklɔu nɛ a kɛ yihi bɔe. A ngɛ kaa yo nɛ li nyumu; nɛ a nyɛɛ Tobi ɔ se kɛ yaa he fɛɛ he nɛ e yaa. A he mɛ kɛ je zugba a nɔ nimli ɔmɛ a kpɛti kaa afɔlehi nɛ a tsu he kɛ ha Mawu kɛ Tobi ɔ. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />Lakpa yemi be a mi, nɛ piami ko hu be a he.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Nɛ i na bɔfo kpa ko hu nɛ e ngɛ tee kɛ nyɛɛ hiɔwe, nɛ e hɛɛ neneene Manye Munyu ɔ nɛ e yaa fiɛ kɛ ha nihi nɛ ngɛ zugba a nɔ, nɛ ji ma tsuaa ma, wɛtso fɛɛ wɛtso, gbi fɛɛ gbi kɛ nimli kulaa.<verse eid="REV 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />E kpa ngmlaa nɛ e de ke, “Nyɛɛ ye Mawu gbeye nɛ nyɛɛ wo e hɛ mi nyami. Ejakaa be ɔ su nɛ e maa kojo. Nyɛ sɔmɔ lɛ, nɔ nɛ bɔ hiɔwe kɛ zugba kɛ wo kɛ nyu hɛ ngmɛhi ɔ!”<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Kɛkɛ nɛ bɔfo kpa ko hu nyɛɛ e se kɛ gu kɔɔhiɔ mi, nɛ e ngɛ dee ke, “Babilon butu, e butu, jamɛ a ma ngua a, ejakaa e kɛ majemaje ɔ bɔ ajuama nɛ e ha a nu e mu kɛ e yayami wai ɔ eko.”<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Jehanɛ ɔ, bɔfo etɛne nyɛɛ a se nɛ e ngɛ ngmlaa kpae ke, “Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ ngɛ wo mi Lohwe ɔ kɛ e amaga a jae, nɛ e ngɛ e okadi ɔ ngɛ e hɛ nya loo e nine nɔ ɔ, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />e maa nu Mawu mi mi fumi wai ɔ. A plɛ wai ɔ kɛ wo Mawu mi mi fumi kɔɔpoo ɔ mi, nɛ a futuu we mi. A ma ha nɛ e na nɔ́ ngɛ la glegleegle ɔ mi ngɛ bɔfo klɔuklɔu ɔmɛ kɛ Tobi ɔ hɛ mi. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />A nɔ nami la su ku ɔ se be poe, nɛ a be he jɔmi nae nyɔ kɛ pia. Ejakaa a ja Lohwe ɔ kɛ e amaga a, nɛ a kɛ e biɛ he okadi wo a he so. <verse eid="REV 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Enɛ ɔ nɛ wo Mawu nimli ɔmɛ he wami nɛ a na tsui si tomi ngɛ a haomi ɔmɛ a mi, ejakaa mɛ ji e klɔuklɔu bi ɔmɛ nɛ daa si kpɛii kɛ yaa nyagbe, nɛ a yeɔ e mlaa amɛ a nɔ, nɛ a ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi ngɛ Yesu mi.”<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Nɛ i nu gbi ko kɛ je Hiɔwe de mi ke, “Moo ngma nɔ́ nɛ ɔ: A gbaa nihi nɛ gboɔ ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi kɛ je mwɔnɛ ɔ kɛ yaa nɛ ɔ.” Mumi ɔ ke, “Ee, niinɛ a nɔ́ ji gbaami, konɛ a jɔɔ a he kɛ je a haomi ɔmɛ a mi; se a ni tsumi ɔmɛ maa nyɛɛ a se!” <verse eid="REV 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Kɛkɛ nɛ nina a tsake, nɛ i na bɔ kuu futa kɛ nɔ ko kaa Yesu, nɔ nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke “Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ” hii si ngɛ nɔ. Nɛ sika tsu akeklee ngɛ e yi kpɛti, nɛ ngma kpami ha nɛ nya ba ngɛ e dɛ mi.<verse eid="REV 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zugba a nɔ ni kpami be su</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Nɛ bɔfo ko je sɔlemi tsu ɔ mi kɛ ba tsɛ lɛ nɛ e de ke; “Moo ngɔ ha a nɛ o kɛ bɔni ni tsumi, ejakaa ni kpami be ɔ su ha mo. Ni ɔmɛ tsu ngɛ zugba a nɔ.” <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nɔ nɛ hii si ngɛ bɔ kuu ɔ nɔ ɔ fɔ e ngma kpami ha a kɛ fɔ zugba a nɔ, nɛ a bua ngma a nya. <verse eid="REV 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Lɔ ɔ se ɔ, bɔfo kpa ko hu je hiɔwe Sɔlemi tsu ɔ mi, nɛ lɛ hu e hɛɛ ngma kpami ha nya babɛ ko.<verse eid="REV 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi nɔuu ɔ, bɔfo ɔ nɛ hɛɛ he wami nɛ e ma kɛ kpata je ɔ hɛ mi kɛ la a, e kpa ngmlaa nɛ e de bɔfo ɔ nɛ hɛɛ ngma kpami ha a ke, “Moo ngɔ o ha a jehanɛ ɔ nɛ o poo wai yiblii sawu ɔmɛ ngɛ wai tso ɔmɛ a he ngɛ zugba a nɔ, ejakaa wai yiblii ɔmɛ tsu.” <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, bɔfo ɔ fɔ e ngma kpami ha a kɛ mane zugba a nɔ, nɛ e bua wai yiblii ɔmɛ a nya kɛ wo Mawu mi mi fumi wai ngami nɔ́ agbo ɔ mi. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Nɛ a naa wai yiblii ɔmɛ a nɔ ngɛ wai ngami nɔ́ ɔ mi ngɛ ma a se. Kɛkɛ nɛ muɔ ke nɛ e be kaa dɔ, nɛ e kami ji si tomi he lafa enyɔ, nɛ e nɔ kuɔmi maa pee okpɔngɔ nya mi dade nɔ kuɔmi.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s1">Tobi ɔ kɛ Mose a la a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />I na nyakpɛ nɔ́ agbo kpa ko ngɛ hiɔwe nɛ tsɔɔ níhi nɛ maa ba. I na bɔfohi kpaago nɛ a ngɔ aja kpaago nɛ piɛ ɔ kɛ ha mɛ kaa a wo kɛ ba zugba a nɔ. Nɛ lɔ ɔ ji nɔ́ nɛ a ma kɛ tsu Mawu mi mi fumi ɔ he ni kɛ gbe nya.<verse eid="REV 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Jehanɛ ɔ, i na nɔ́ ko kaa wo nɛ ngɛ kaa ahuhuɛ nɛ la ngɛ mi. Nɛ nihi kulaa nɛ ye musu Lohwe ɔ kɛ e amaga kɛ e okadi kɛ yi bɔ ɔ nɔ kunimi ɔ daa si ngɛ wo nɛ ngɛ kaa ahuhuɛ ɔ nɔ. Mɛ tsuo a hɛɛ Mawu saku ɔmɛ <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />nɛ a ngɛ Tobi ɔ la, kɛ Mawu tsɔlɔ Mose la lae ke: “Nutsɔ Mawu Ope, o ni tsumi ɔmɛ kle, nɛ a ngɛ nyakpɛ! Oo Neneene Matsɛ, o blɔ ɔmɛ da, nɛ a ji anɔkuale.<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Mɛnɔ po nɛ be mo gbeye yee, oo Nutsɔ, nɛ e be o biɛ ɔ hɛ mi nyami woe? Ejakaa mo pɛ nɛ o ngɛ klɔuklɔu. Je mi ma amɛ kulaa maa ba nɛ a ba ja ngɛ o hɛ mi. Ejakaa o dami ní ɔmɛ ɔ, a je mɛ kpo paa.”<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Jehanɛ se ɔ, i hyɛ nɛ i na nɛ a bli Hiɔwe sɔlemi tsu ɔ He Klɔuklɔu ɔ nya gbajaa!<verse eid="REV 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Nɛ bɔfohi kpaago nɛ hɛɛ aja kpaago ɔmɛ je kpo kɛ je Sɔlemi tsu ɔ mi kɛ a he tade futafuta kɛ a mlɛmi fimi nɔ nɛ a kɛ sika tsu pee. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Nɛ hɛ kali eywiɛ ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake ha a kpɛti nɔ tsuaa nɔ sika tsu kpluu nɛ hyi tɔtɔɔtɔ kɛ Mawu Hɛ Kalɔ nɛ ngɛ daa a mi mi fumi nɛ he ngɛ gbeye ɔ. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Sɔlemi tsu ɔ hyi kɛ la su ku nɛ je Mawu anunyami kɛ e he wami ɔ mi. Nɛ nɔ ko be sɔlemi tsu ɔ mi nyɛe maa sɛ, ja bɔfohi kpaago ɔmɛ ngɔ aja kpaago ɔmɛ kɛ pue si gbe nya.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s1">Bɔfohi kpaago ɔmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Nɛ i nu gbi ko nɛ nya wa kɛ je sɔlemi tsu ɔ mi nɛ ngɛ bɔfohi kpaago ɔmɛ dee ke, “Jehanɛ ɔ, nyɛɛ ya nɛ nyɛ ya plɛ Mawu mi mi fumi ɔ ngɛ kpluu kpaago ɔmɛ a mi kɛ pue zugba a nɔ.”<verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, kekle bɔfo ɔ je sɔlemi tsu ɔ mi nɛ e ya plɛ nɔ nɛ ngɛ e kpluu ɔ mi ɔ ngɔ pue zugba a nɔ. Kɛkɛ nɛ nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ Lohwe ɔ he okadi ngɛ e he nɛ e ngɛ Lohwe ɔ e amaga a jae ɔ hia pa yayahi nɛ yee nɔ.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Bɔfo enyɔne ɔ plɛ e kpluu ɔ mi nɔ́ ɔ ngɔ pue wo ɔmɛ a mi, nɛ a mi nyu ɔmɛ plɛ nɔ gbogboe mi muɔ. Nɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ngɛ wo ɔmɛ a mi ɔ gbo.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Bɔfo etɛne ɔ plɛ e kpluu ɔ mi nɔ́ ɔ ngɔ pue pa amɛ kɛ nyu hɛ ngmɛ ɔmɛ a mi nɛ a plɛ muɔ. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Nɛ i nu nɛ nyu ɔmɛ a bɔfo nɛ ɔ ngɛ dee ke, “Oo Tsɛ Klɔuklɔu, mo nɔ nɛ o ngɛ, kɛ nɔ nɛ o hi si sa a, dalɔ ji mo, nɛ o kojomi nɛ ɔ sa. <verse eid="REV 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Ejakaa a gbe o nimli klɔuklɔuhi kɛ o gbali ɔmɛ nɛ a muɔ pue si ngɛ zugba a nɔ. Nɛ ngɛ a he je ɔ, mo hu o pue nihi nɛ gbe mɛ ɔ a muɔ si. Hiɔwo nɛ sa mɛ pɛ ji lɔ ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="REV 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Nɛ i nu nɛ afɔle sami la tɛ ɔ e bɔfo ɔ de ke, “Ee, Nutsɔ Mawu Ope, o kojomi ɔmɛ da nɛ a ji anɔkuale.”<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Jehanɛ ɔ, bɔfo eywiɛne ɔ plɛ e kpluu ɔ mi nɔ ɔ kɛ pue pu ɔ nɔ. Nɛ lɔ ɔ ha nɛ pu ɔ tso wawɛɛ nɛ e saa nimli kɛ e la a. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ ngla kɛ e la dɔdɔɛ ɔ. Kɛkɛ nɛ a tu musu bɔmi munyu kɛ si Mawu, nɔ nɛ wo aja amɛ kɛ ba a. Se a tsakee we a juɛmi kɛ a je mi bami kɛ ha e hɛ mi nyami womi.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Jehanɛ ɔ, bɔfo enuɔne ɔ plɛ e kpluu ɔ mi nɔ́ ɔ kɛ pue Lohwe ɔ nɛ je wo ɔ mi ɔ e matsɛ sɛ ɔ nɔ. Kɛkɛ nɛ e matsɛ yemi he ɔ kulaa wo diblii. Nɛ e sisi bi ɔmɛ ta a lilɛ ngɛ nɔ nami he je. <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />Nɛ a tu musu bɔmi munyuhi kɛ si Mawu ngɛ a nɔ nami kɛ pa amɛ a he. Se a kua a tsui tsakemi ngɛ a ni yayami peemi ɔmɛ a he.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Bɔfo nɛ ji ekpa a plɛ e kpluu ɔ mi nɔ ɔ kɛ pue Yufrate pa a mi nɛ e mi gbli. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, matsɛmɛ nɛ je pu site he ɔ ngɔ a ta hwuli ɔmɛ kɛ be kɛ ho pu sinɔ he blɔ ya nɛ nɔ ko tsi we mɛ blɔ. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Nɛ i na mumi yayamihi etɛ nɛ dla a he kaa ovɔnɔhi nɛ a tuu kɛ je Gbeye Lohwe ɔ nya mi kɛ Lohwe ɔ nɛ je wo ɔ mi ɔ kɛ e lakpa Gbalɔ ɔ a nya mi. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Mumi yayamihi nɛ peeɔ nyakpɛ níhi ya na matsɛhi ngɛ je ɔ mi kulaa konɛ a bua a nya nɛ a je ta kɛ wo Nutsɔ ɔ he ngɛ Mawu Ope ɔ Kojomi Ligbi ngua nɛ ma a nɔ.<verse eid="REV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />“Nyɛɛ hyɛ, i ma ba tlukaa kaa julɔ! A jɔɔ nihi kulaa nɛ ngɛ mi mlɛe nɛ a ngɛ a tade ɔmɛ a nɔ hyɛe saminya konɛ a ko nyɛɛ he gu nɛ a hɛ mi ba pue si ɔ.”<verse eid="REV 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Nɛ a bua a ta amɛ ngɛ je ɔ mi ɔ tsuo nya ngɛ he ko nɛ a tsɛɛ ngɛ Hebri gbi mi ke Armagedon ɔ, nɛ ji Megido Yoku ɔ.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Kɛkɛ nɛ bɔfo nɛ ji kpaago ɔ plɛ e kpluu ɔ mi nɔ ɔ kɛ wo kɔɔhiɔ mi; nɛ gbi ko pɛ wawɛɛ kɛ je Hiɔwe sɔlemi tsu ɔ mi ngɛ matsɛ sɛ ɔ he ke, “A gbe nya!” <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Jehanɛ ɔ Hiɔwe si nɛ e pa la, nɛ zugba hoso wawɛɛ. Zugba hosoo we ja hyɛ kɛ je benɛ nɔmlɔ bɔ ade ngɛ zugba a nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Nɛ Babilon, ma ngua a mi gba etɛ, nɛ je mi ma ngua amɛ butu. Mawu kai Babilon yayami ɔmɛ tsuo, nɛ e gbla e tue, nɛ e ha nɛ e nu e mi mi fumi wai kɔɔpoo ɔ kulaa. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Nɛ wo kpɔhi laa, yokuhi sɛ si nɛ a pee tɛtlɛɛ. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Hiɔmi tɛ nguahi nɛ a jiɔmi maa su sɛ ni tɛ jiɔmi lafa je Hiɔwe ba nɛ pue nimli a nɔ ngɛ zugba a nɔ. Nɛ a tu musu bɔmi munyuhi kɛ si Mawu ngɛ hiɔmi tɛhi nɛ a he ngɛ gbeye nɛ ɔmɛ a he.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yo tsutsu ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Nɛ bɔfohi kpaago ɔmɛ nɛ plɛ a kpluu ɔmɛ a mi ni ɔmɛ pue si ɔ a ti nɔ kake ba nɛ e kɛ mi ba tu munyu ke, “Moo ba nɛ waa ho nɛ ma ya tsɔɔ mo nɔ nɛ maa ba jamɛ a yo ajuama kpanaku ɔ nɔ, nɔ nɛ hii si ngɛ nyu babauu nɔ ngɛ je ɔ mi ɔ. <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />Je mi matsɛ ɔmɛ kɛ lɛ bɔ ajuama, nɛ e ajuama bɔmi wai ɔ ha zugba a nɔ bimɛ de da.”<verse eid="REV 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Kɛkɛ nɛ bɔfo ɔ wo mi ngɛ mumi mi kɛ ho nga a nɔ ya. Nɛ i na yo ko nɛ hii si ngɛ lohwe nɛ tsuɔ kaa muɔ nɔ. Lohwe ɔ ngɛ yihi kpaago kɛ kolihi nyɔngma nɛ a ngma Mawu he musu bɔmi munyu kɛ bɔle a he. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Yo ɔ wo tade nɛ tsuɔ nɛ hɛɛ alamua su hulɔ. Nɛ e wo sika tsu june nɛ ngɛ fɛu kɛ adiagba kɛ muɛhi nɛ a he jua wa, nɛ e hɛɛ sika tsu kpluu nɛ hyi tɔtɔɔtɔ kɛ yakayaka kɛ mu níhi ngɛ e dɛ mi.<verse eid="REV 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Nɛ a ngma nyakpɛ biɛ ko nɛ ji laami munyu ngɛ e hɛ nya ke, “Babilon ngua a, ajuama bɔli kɛ je ɔ mi wɔ jali tsuo a nyɛ.”<verse eid="REV 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />I na kaa klɔuklɔu bi ɔmɛ kɛ Yesu he odase yeli ɔmɛ nɛ e gbe ɔ a muɔ ha nɛ e de da. Benɛ i na lɛ ɔ ye nya kpɛ ye he.<verse eid="REV 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Nɛ bɔfo ɔ bi mi ke, “Mɛni ba nɛ o nya kpɛ o he kikɛ ɔ? I ma tsɔɔ mo nɔmlɔ nɛ e ji, kɛ nɔ́ nɛ lohwe ɔ nɛ e kuɔ ɔ ji. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Jinɛ lohwe ɔ hi wami mi hyɛ, se piɔ ɔ e gbo. Se kɛ ɔ, e be kɛe nɛ e maa te si kɛ je muɔ voo nɛ a nɛ e sisi ɔ mi kɛ ho neneene hɛ mi kpatami mi ya. Nɛ zugba a nɔ nimli nɛ a ngmɛ a biɛ ngɛ Wami Womi ɔ mi loko ji je ɔ bɔ ade ɔ, a nya maa kpɛ a he kaa lohwe ɔ ba je kpo ekohu ngɛ e gbenɔ se.<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />Jehanɛ ɔ, mo susu he saminya, e yihi kpaago ɔmɛ daa si kɛ ha ma ko nɛ a ma lɛ ngɛ yokuhi kpaago a nɔ, he nɛ yo nɛ ɔ we ngɛ. <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />Nɛ a daa si kɛ ha niatsɛhi kpaago hulɔ. A kpɛti nihi enuɔ gbo momo, nɛ ekpane ɔ ngɛ matsɛ yee amlɔ nɛ ɔ. E piɛ kpaagone ɔ nɛ maa ba, se lɛɛ e matsɛ yemi ɔ se be kɛe. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Lohwe tsutsu ɔ nɛ gbo ɔ ji matsɛ kpaanyɔne ɔ. E ye matsɛ momo kaa matsɛ kpaago ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake. Nɛ ngɛ e matsɛ yemi enyɔne ɔ se ɔ, lɛ hu e maa ya hɛ mi kpatami mi. <verse eid="REV 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />E kolihi nyɔngma amɛ daa si kɛ ha tsɛ yeli nyɔngma nɛ a wui mɛ matsɛ lolo. A maa wo mɛ matsɛ be kpiti kɛkɛ, nɛ a kɛ lɛ maa ye matsɛ. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Mɛ tsuo a maa wo si kaa a maa ngɔ a matsɛ yemi kɛ he wami ɔ kɛ ha lɛ. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Mɛ tsuo a ma je ta kɛ wo Tobi ɔ, se Tobi ɔ maa ye a nɔ. Ejakaa nutsɔhi a Nutsɔ kɛ matsɛhi a Matsɛ ji lɛ, nɛ e nimli ɔmɛ ji nihi nɛ a hla nɛ a tsɛ, nɛ a ji anɔkuale yeli.<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Wo ɔmɛ kɛ pa amɛ kɛ dɔbo ɔmɛ nɛ yo ɔ hii si ngɛ nɔ ɔ daa si kɛ ha nimli abɔ ngɛ je ɔ mi tsuo.<verse eid="REV 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Lohwe tsutsu kɛ e kolihi nyɔngma a nɛ daa si kɛ ha matsɛhi nyɔngma a nɛ a kɛ lɛ maa ye matsɛ ɔ, mɛ tsuo a sume yo ɔ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a kɛ lɛ maa kpe. A ma kpɔ e níhi kulaa ngɛ e dɛ nɛ a ma si lɛ kɛ e he gu nɛ la ma kpata e hɛ mi. <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />Ejakaa Mawu ma wo juɛmi ko kɛ wo a yi mi, juɛmi nɛ ma tsu e yi mi tomi he ni. Lɔ ɔ ji kaa mɛ tsuo a maa kplɛɛ kaa a maa ngɔ a matsɛ yemi he wami ɔ kɛ ha lohwe tsutsu ɔ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ Mawu munyu ɔmɛ nɛ ba mi. <verse eid="REV 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />Nɛ yo nɛ ɔ nɛ o na ngɛ o nina mi ɔ daa si kɛ ha ma agbo ɔ nɛ ngɛ zugba a nɔ matsɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ yee ɔ.”<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s1">Ma ngua a ywiami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Ni nɛ ɔmɛ kulaa a se ɔ, i na bɔfo kpa ko nɛ kple si kɛ je hiɔwe kɛ nɔ yemi he wami agbo. Kɛkɛ nɛ e anunyami ɔ ha nɛ zugba a nɔ tsuo tsɔ heii.<verse eid="REV 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />E kpa ngmlaa wawɛɛ ke, “Babilon Agbo ɔ ywia, e ywia! E plɛ mumi yayamihi a sihi he kɛ mumi yayamihi kulaa a tsu, kɛ lohwe pɛlitsɛhi nɛ a he tsɔ we, nɛ a he ngɛ tai ɔ a tsu. <verse eid="REV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Ejakaa ma amɛ tsuo nu e ajuama bɔmi ɔ he hɛ mi kpatami wai ɔ eko. Zugba a nɔ matsɛ ɔmɛ kɛ lɛ bɔ ajuama, nɛ jua yeli ngɛ je ɔ mi tsuo na ní kɛ gu e si himi ɔ nɔ.”<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Jehanɛ ɔ, i nu gbi kpa ko nɛ ngɛ ngmlaa kpae ke, “Ye we bimɛ, nyɛɛ je yo ɔ ngɔ kɛ ba! Nyɛɛ kɛ nyɛ he nɛ ko wo e yayami peemi ɔ mi, nɛ nyɛ ko na e tue gblami ɔ eko. <verse eid="REV 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />Ejakaa e he yayami ɔmɛ hiɛ nɛ a su hiɔwe, nɛ Mawu pee klaalo nɛ e maa kojo lɛ ngɛ e tɔmi ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="REV 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Nyɛɛ pee lɛ kaa bɔ nɛ e pee nyɛ ɔ, nɛ nyɛɛ wo lɛ e ni peemi ni ɔmɛ a he hiɔ ngwɔ he enyɔ. E hao nihi, nyɛ ha nɛ lɛ hu e na haomi ja a ngwɔ he enyɔ. <verse eid="REV 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />E hi si ngɛ ni nami kɛ bua jɔmi mi. Se jehanɛ ɔ, nyɛ ha nɛ e na haomi kɛ aywilɛho. E fĩaa ke, ‘Manyɛ ji mi ngɛ ye sɛ ɔ nɔ. Tsa pi ahoyo nɛ ni ngɛ mɔbɔ ji mi. I be aywilɛho yee.’ <verse eid="REV 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, gbenɔ he aywilɛho kɛ mɔbɔ yemi kɛ hwɔ nɛ nya wa maa ba e nɔ ngɛ ligbi kake too mi, nɛ la ma kpata e hɛ mi butuu. Ejakaa Nutsɔ ɔ nɛ ngɛ lɛ kojoe ɔ e kle.”<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Nɛ benɛ la su ku ɔ ngɛ si tee ngɛ he nɛ e ngla ngɛ ɔ, zugba a nɔ matsɛ ɔmɛ nɛ a kɛ lɛ bɔ ajuama, nɛ a na níhi kɛ je e dɛ ɔ, a maa ye aywilɛho nɛ a ma fo ya kɛ ha lɛ. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />A maa da si ngɛ se tsitsaa kɛ he kpokpomi kɛ gbeye yemi nɛ a ma kpa ngmlaa ke, “Ao, Babilon, jamɛ a ma ngua a! Ngmlɛfia kake mi pɛ nɛ o hɛ mi kpata.”<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Zugba a nɔ jua yeli ɔmɛ ma fo ya nɛ a maa ye kɔmɔ kɛ ha lɛ, ejakaa nɔ ko be hu nɛ ma he a tlomi ɔmɛ. <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />Lɛ ji a jua yelɔ ngua pe kulaa nɛ heɔ a sika tsu kɛ sika hiɔ, tɛhi kɛ muɛhi nɛ a he jua wa, klala kpakpahi, sliiki yumuhi kɛ níhi nɛ hɛɛ alamua su, tso fɛɛ tso nɛ jee via, suɔ wu níhi kɛ níhi kulaa nɛ a kɛ tso nɛ he jua wa pee, ayawa kɛ dade kɛ tɛ kpa komɛ. <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />Ekomɛ hu ji mimɛhi kɛ nu je viahi, la su ku womi tsopahi, nu kpakpa kɛ ohɛ, wai kɛ sikisia kpakpa, ngma, nahi kɛ tohi, okpɔngɔhi kɛ trɔkehi, nyɔguɛhi kɛ nimli a susumahi tete.<verse eid="REV 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />Nɛ a kpa ngmlaa ke, “O tsui suɔmi nya ni ɔmɛ kulaa laa mo. Afɛu níhi nɛ kpɛɔ nɛ o suɔ saminya a, o be nae hu. A laa kulaa.”<verse eid="REV 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Nɛ jua yeli ɔmɛ nɛ plɛ niatsɛmɛ ngɛ ní nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ a juaa kɛ haa lɛ ɔ he je ɔ, a ma ya da si ngɛ se lokoo, ngɛ gbeye yemi nya, nɛ a ma fo ya nɛ a ma de ke, <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />“Ao, jamɛ a ma ngua a! E ngɛ fɛu kaa yo nɛ bu bo tsutsu nɛ he jua wa nɛ hɛɛ alamua su hulɔ. Nɛ e wlua kɛ sika tsu gahi kɛ kuɛ níhi kɛ muɛhi nɛ he jua wa. <verse eid="REV 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />Ngɛ ngmlɛfia mi ɔ, a kpata e ni kpakpa amɛ kulaa hɛ mi!” Nɛ jua yemi lɛtsɛ ɔmɛ, kɛ kudɔli ɔmɛ kɛ lɛ mi bi ɔmɛ ma ya da si ngɛ se lokoo, <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />nɛ a maa hyɛ la su ku ɔ nɛ ngɛ jee ɔ, nɛ a ma kpa ngmlaa ke, “Je ɔ mi kulaa jije a maa na ma nɛ ngɛ kaa enɛ ɔ ngɛ?” <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Nɛ a maa muɔ zu kɛ pue a yi kpɛti benɛ a ngɛ ya foe ɔ, nɛ a ma de ke, “Ao, ao, jamɛ a ma ngua a! E ha nɛ wɔ tsuo wa plɛ niatsɛmɛ kɛ je e ni nami babauu ɔ mi. Nɛ jehanɛ ɔ, kulaa laa ngɛ ngmlɛfia mi!”<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />Oo hiɔwe, mo nya ngɛ e hɛ mi kpatami ɔ he. Nyɛ nya, oo Mawu bimɛ kɛ gbali ɔmɛ kɛ bɔfo ɔmɛ. Ejakaa Mawu kojo lɛ kɛ ha nyɛ.<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Kɛkɛ nɛ bɔfo ngua ko wo tɛ nɛ ngɛ kaa wɛɛmi tɛ, nɛ e fia lɛ kɛ mane wo ɔ mi nɛ e kpa ngmlaa ke, “Babilon, jamɛ a ma ngua a! A ma sake lɛ kɛ fɔ he kaa bɔ nɛ i fia tɛ nɛ ɔ kɛ mane ɔ, nɛ e maa laa kulaa. <verse eid="REV 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />Nɛ a be la he nue ngɛ lejɛ ɔ hu. A be saku kɛ kpa saku kɛ bliigo he nue hu. A be jua yemi ni tsumi ko nae ngɛ lejɛ ɔ hu, nɛ a be blɛfo gblɛe hu. <verse eid="REV 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />E nyɔ mi ɔmɛ maa wo diblii, nɛ a be kane tete nae ngɛ saflɛ mi hu. A be yo kpeemi ngmlɛ ɔmɛ kɛ ayɛflo kɛ ayɛflo huno ɔ a gbi ngɔngɔɛ ɔmɛ a he nue hu. A lɛɛ jua yeli ɔmɛ ngɛ je ɔ mi, nɛ e ngɔ kunya kɛ sisi ma amɛ kulaa. <verse eid="REV 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Nɛ a ma bi gbali ɔmɛ kɛ he tsɔli ɔmɛ kulaa nɛ a gbe ɔ a muɔ si ngɛ e dɛ.”<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="s1">Asafo ɔ nyaa ngɛ hiɔwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, i nu nihi babauu a ngmlaa kpami he ngɛ hiɔwe ke, “Haleluya! Nyɛ je Nutsɔ ɔ yi! Yi wami hemi maa je wa Mawu ɔ ngɔ. E nɔ́ ji anunyami kɛ he wami. <verse eid="REV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />Ejakaa e kojomi ɔmɛ da nɛ a ji anɔkuale. E gbla yo ajuama kpanaku ɔ nɛ puɛ zugba a nɔ kɛ ajuama bɔmi ɔ tue, nɛ e wo e tsɔli ɔmɛ nɛ a gbe ɔ he hiɔ.”<verse eid="REV 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />A ngɛ ngmlaa a kpae be fɛɛ be ke, “Nyɛ je Nutsɔ ɔ yi! Yo ɔ nɛ ngla a la su ku ɔ maa kuɔ kɛ ya hiɔwe daa kɛ daa!”<verse eid="REV 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Kɛkɛ nɛ nikɔtɔmahi nyingmi enyɔ kɛ eywiɛ ɔ kɛ hɛ kali eywiɛ ɔmɛ kpla si nɛ a ja Mawu, nɔ nɛ hii si ngɛ matsɛ sɛ ɔ nɔ ɔ, nɛ a de ke, “Amen! Haleluya! Nyɛ je Mawu yi!”<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Nɛ gbi ko je matsɛ sɛ ɔ mi de ke, “Nyɛ je wa Mawu ɔ yi, nyɛ e sɔmɔli ɔmɛ kulaa, nyɛ nimli guhi kɛ nimli nguahi tsuo nɛ yee lɛ gbeye ɔ.”<verse eid="REV 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Jehanɛ ɔ, i nu nɔ́ ko he ekohu kaa nimli babauu nɛ ngɛ ngmlaa kpae, loo wohi lafa a oslɔkehi nɛ ba ngɛ kue ngɛ wo dɔ mi, loo kaa hiɔwe simi ngua ko ke, “Nyɛ je Nutsɔ ɔ yi! Ejakaa Nutsɔ wa Mawu Ope ɔ ngɛ matsɛ yee. <verse eid="REV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Nyɛ ha nɛ wa bua nɛ jɔ nɛ wa nya nɛ waa wo e hɛ mi nyami. Ejakaa Tobi ɔ yo kpeemi be ɔ su, nɛ e ayɛflo ɔ dla e he gbe nya. <verse eid="REV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />A ha lɛ he blɔ nɛ e wo tade futa nɛ he tsɔ, nɛ e ji bo kpakpa tade.” Bo kpakpa a daa si kɛ ha Mawu nimli ɔmɛ a ni kpakpa peemi ɔmɛ.<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Nɛ bɔfo ɔ de mi ke, “Ngmaa munyu nɛ ɔ; A jɔɔ nihi nɛ a kpee mɛ kɛ ba Tobi ɔ yo kpeemi okplɔɔ ɔ he ɔ!” Nɛ e tsa nɔ nɛ e de ke, “Mawu nitsɛ nɛ e tu munyu nɛ ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="REV 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Kɛkɛ nɛ i kpla si ngɛ e nane nya nɛ ma ja lɛ. Se e de mi ke, “Dabi! Mo ko pee! Ejakaa Mawu sɔmɔlɔ ji mi kaa bɔ nɛ o ngɛ ɔ, kɛ bɔ nɛ o nyɛmimɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ ngɛ ɔ, nihi nɛ ye a hemi kɛ yemi ngɛ Yesu mi ɔ he odase ɔ. Nɛ gbami ɔmɛ kulaa kɛ níhi kulaa nɛ i je ngɔ tsɔɔ mo nɛ ɔ, Yesu he munyu nɛ a ngɛ tue.”<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Matsɛmɛ a Matsɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Jehanɛ ɔ, i na nɛ a bli hiɔwe nya, nɛ i na okpɔngɔ futa ko nɛ daa si ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. Nɔ nɛ hii si ngɛ okpɔngɔ ɔ nɔ ɔ biɛ ji “Anɔkualetsɛ kɛ Dalɔ.” Lɛ ji nɔ nɛ kojoɔ ngɛ dami nya nɛ e jeɔ ta. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />E hɛ ngmɛhi tsuɔ kaa la, nɛ e bu matsɛ pɛɛhi babauu. A ngma biɛ ko ngɛ e hɛ nya, nɛ lɛ pɛ ji nɔ nɛ le e sisi. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />E wo tade nɛ a kɛ wo muɔ mi, nɛ e biɛ ji “Mawu Munyu ɔ.” <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Hiɔwe ta hwuli nɛ wo afɛu bo kpakpa tade hiɔhi nɛ he tsɔ nyɛɛ e se ngɛ okpɔngɔ hiɔhi a nɔ.<verse eid="REV 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Nɛ ta yami ha nɛ nya ba saminya ngɛ e nya he nɛ e ma kɛ kpata ma amɛ a hɛ mi. E ma kpaka mɛ kɛ dade, nɛ e maa naa wai ngami nɔ́ ɔ, nɛ ji Mawu Ope ɔ mi mi fumi nɛ nya wa a nɔ. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />A ngma ngɛ e tade ɔ kɛ e fiɔ nɔ ke, “Matsɛmɛ a Matsɛ kɛ Nutsɔmɛ a Nutsɔ.”<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Jehanɛ ɔ, i na bɔfo ko nɛ daa si ngɛ pu ɔ nɔ, nɛ e ngɛ ngmlaa kpae wawɛɛ kɛ ngɛ lohwe pɛlitsɛ ɔmɛ tsɛe ke, “Nyɛɛ ba! Nyɛ ba bua nyɛ he nya kɛ ha Mawu Ope ɔ gbɔkuɛ niye ni ɔ! <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />Nyɛɛ ba nɛ nyɛ ba ye matsɛmɛ a he lo kɛ asafoatsɛmɛ kɛ tatsɛ nguahi, okpɔngɔhi kɛ a nɔ hili kɛ adesahi tsuo, nimli nguahi kɛ nimli guhi, nyɔguɛhi kɛ odehehi a he lo.”<verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Jehanɛ ɔ, i na Lohwe musutsɛ ɔ nɛ e ngɛ zugba a nɔ matsɛmɛ kɛ a ta hwuli tsuo a nya buae, nɛ a kɛ nɔ nɛ hii si ngɛ okpɔngɔ ɔ nɔ kɛ e ta hwuli ɔmɛ nɛ a hwu ta. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Nɛ a nu Lohwe musutsɛ ɔ kɛ nyangɔ gbalɔ ɔ, nɔ nɛ peeɔ nyakpɛ ni nguahi ngɛ Lohwe musutsɛ ɔ hɛ mi nɛ e kɛ mlɔɔ nihi kulaa nɛ hɛɛ Lohwe musutsɛ ɔ he okadi, kɛ nihi nɛ ja e amaga a. Nɛ a sake mɛ nihi enyɔ ɔmɛ tsuo hɛ ngmengmle kɛ fɔ La Taku nɛ ngɛ tsoe glegleegle ɔ mi. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Nɛ a kpata a ta hwuli ɔmɛ tsuo a hɛ mi kɛ ta yami ha nɛ nya ba a, nɛ ngɛ okpɔngɔ futa nɔ hilɔ ɔ nya he ɔ. Nɛ hiɔwe lohwe pɛlitsɛhi ye a lo nɛ a tɔ.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s1">A fi Abosiami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Nɛ i na bɔfo ko nɛ je Hiɔwe kɛ ba zugba. E hɛɛ muɔ voo nɛ a nɛ e sisi ɔ nya safie kɛ kɔsɔkɔsɔ agbo ngɛ e dɛ mi. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e nu Gbeye Lohwe ɔ nɛ ji blema sinɔ ɔ loo Abosiami ɔ nɛ e wo lɛ kɔsɔkɔsɔ ɔ, nɛ e maa hi kɔsɔkɔsɔ ɔ mi kɛ ya si jeha akpe kake. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Nɛ e tsitsiɛ lɛ kɛ wo muɔ voo nɛ a nɛ e sisi ɔ mi. E nga muɔ ɔ nya nɛ e ngmɛ mi bɔ nɛ pee nɛ e ko sisi ma amɛ hu kɛ ya si jeha akpe ɔ nya ma ta. Nɛ jamɛ a be ɔ se ɔ, a maa ngmɛɛ e he bɔɔ.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Jehanɛ ɔ i na matsɛ sɛhi, nɛ nihi nɛ a ha mɛ he blɔ kaa a kojo ɔ hii si ngɛ a nɔ. Nɛ i na nihi nɛ a gbe mɛ ngɛ Yesu he odase yemi kɛ Mawu Munyu ɔ fiɛmi he ɔ a susumahi; kɛ nihi nɛ kua Lohwe ɔ loo e amaga a jami, aloo a pee we e okadi ɔ ngɛ a hɛ nya loo a kɔni nɔ ɔ. A kpale kɛ ba wami mi ekohu nɛ a kɛ Kristo ngɛ matsɛ yee kɛ yaa jeha akpe.<verse eid="REV 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />Gbogboehi a si temi kekle nɔ ɔ ji enɛ ɔ nɛ. Gbogboe ɔmɛ nɛ piɛ ɔ be si tee kɛ ba wami mi kɛ ya si jeha akpe ɔ nyagbe. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Nihi nɛ ngɛ klɔuklɔu nɛ a jɔɔ mɛ ɔ piɛɛ kekle nihi nɛ a tle mɛ si ɔ a he. Jamɛatsɛ ɔmɛ ɔ, gbenɔ nɛ ji enyɔne ɔ be a nɔ he wami. Ejakaa a maa pee Mawu kɛ Kristo osɔfohi, nɛ a kɛ lɛ maa ye matsɛ jeha akpe.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Jeha akpe ɔ nyagbe mi ɔ, a ma je Abosiami kpo kɛ je e tsu ɔ mi. <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />E ma ya sisi jemi ma amɛ nɛ ji Gog kɛ Magog, nɛ e ma bua a nya kɛ ha ta hwumi. Nɛ e ma na ta hwuli babauu kaa bɔ nɛ wo nya kewu ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />A maa nyɛɛ kɛ ya bɔle Mawu nimli ɔmɛ kɛ Yerusalem, ma nɛ a suɔ lɛ ɔ. Se la maa je Mawu ngɔ ngɛ hiɔwe nɛ e ma kpata a hɛ mi.<verse eid="REV 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Nɛ Abosiami nɛ sisi mɛ ɔ, a maa ngɔ lɛ kɛ wo La Taku nɛ ngɛ tsoe glegleegle ɔ mi, he nɛ Lohwe ɔ kɛ Lakpa Gbalɔ ɔ ngɛ ɔ, nɛ a ma pi mɛ nyɔ kɛ pia kɛ ya neneene.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />I na matsɛ sɛ hiɔ agbo ko kɛ nɔ nɛ hii si ngɛ nɔ ɔ. Nɛ zugba kɛ hiɔwe tu fo kɛ je e hɛ mi, se a nɛ laami he. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Nɛ i na ni gbogboe ɔmɛ, nimli nguahi kɛ nimli guhi nɛ daa si ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi. A bli Womi ɔmɛ kɛ Wami Womi ɔ a nya. Nɛ a kojo gbogboe ɔmɛ ngɛ níhi nɛ a ngma ngɛ Womi ɔmɛ a mi ɔ kɛ níhi nɛ nɔ fɛɛ nɔ pee ɔ nya. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Wo ɔmɛ ngɔ ni gbogboehi nɛ ngɛ a mi ɔ kɛ ha. Nɛ zugba a kɛ gbeje hu je gbogboehi nɛ ngɛ a mi ɔ kɛ ha. Nɛ a kojo nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ e ni tsumi ɔmɛ a nya. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Nɛ a sake Gbenɔ kɛ Gbeje kɛ wo La Taku ɔ mi. La Taku ɔ ji gbenɔ nɛ ji enyɔne ɔ. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Nɛ nɔ nɛ a nɛ e biɛ ngɛ Wami Womi ɔ mi ɔ, a sake lɛ kɛ wo La Taku ɔ mi.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s1">Zugba he kɛ hiɔwe he</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Jehanɛ ɔ, i na zugba he, nɛ wohi be nɔ, kɛ hiɔwe he. Ejakaa kekle hiɔwe kɛ kekle zugba a laa. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Nɛ ami Yohane i na Ma Klɔuklɔu nɛ ji Yerusalem he ɔ nɛ je Mawu ngɔ ngɛ hiɔwe kɛ ngɛ si kplɛe. E ji anunyami nɔ́ ko nɛ ngɛ fɛu kaa ayɛflo nɛ a ngɛ lɛ kpee.<verse eid="REV 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />I nu ngmlaa ko kɛ je matsɛ sɛ ɔ nɔ ke, “Hyɛ, Mawu we ɔ ngɛ nimli a kpɛti jehanɛ ɔ. E kɛ mɛ maa hi si, nɛ a maa pee e nimli. Niinɛ, Mawu nitsɛ maa hi a kpɛti. <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />E ma tsu a hɛ mi vo nyu kulaa, nɛ gbenɔ be si hie hu, aywilɛho be, ya fomi be, nɛ nɔ́ nami ko hu be. Ejakaa lɔ ɔmɛ tsuo a se po kulaa.”<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Nɛ nɔ nɛ hii si ngɛ matsɛ sɛ ɔ nɔ ɔ de ke, “Hyɛ, i ngɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ pee ehe!” Kɛkɛ nɛ e de mi ke, “Ngmaa enɛ ɔ kɛ fɔ si, ejakaa nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ mo dee ɔ, e ji anɔkuale nɛ sa nɛ a he ye. <verse eid="REV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />A gbe nya! Ami ji A kɛ Z, Kekle kɛ Nyagbe. I ma ha nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ kuma ngɛ lɛ yee ɔ Wami Nyu nɛ baa a yaka gu. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Nɛ nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ maa ye kunimi ɔ, e nine maa su jɔɔmi nɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ. I ma pee e Mawu, nɛ e maa pee ye bi. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Se gbeye yeli nɛ ma kpa ye se nyɛɛmi, kɛ nihi nɛ yi mi anɔkuale ɔ, nɔ sisili, nimli gbeli kɛ ya holi, nyuali, wɔ jali kɛ lakpatsɛmɛ a nyagbe ji La Taku ɔ nɛ ngɛ tsoe glegleegle ɔ mi. Gbenɔ nɛ ji enyɔne ɔ ji enɛ ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Kɛkɛ nɛ bɔfohi kpaago ɔmɛ nɛ plɛ nyagbe ajahi kpaago ɔmɛ ngɛ kpluu ɔmɛ a mi kɛ pue si ɔ a ti nɔ kake ba de mi ke, “Moo ba nɛ ma tsɔɔ mo ayɛflo ɔ, nɛ ji Tobi ɔ yo ɔ.”<verse eid="REV 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anunyami ma ngua a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Nɛ e wo mi ngɛ ni nami ɔ mi kɛ ho yoku ploplooplo ko yi kpɛti ya, nɛ i na jamɛ a nyakpɛ ma nɛ ji Yerusalem Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ ngɛ si kplee kɛ je Mawu ngɔ ngɛ bɔ kuu ɔmɛ a mi. <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />E hyi kɛ Mawu anunyami ɔ nɛ e ngɛ kpɛe kaa tɛ nɛ he jua wa, nɛ e mi tsɔ kaa nɔ́ ko nɛ ngɛ kaa ahuhuɛ. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />E gbogbo ɔmɛ bli, nɛ a ya hiɔwe, kɛ agbohi nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ nɛ bɔfohi nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ ngɛ bue ngɛ a nya. A ngma Israel wɛtso nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ ɔmɛ a biɛhi ngɛ agbo ɔmɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Agbohi etɛ ngɛ kasa fɛɛ kasa, wo mi blɔ, jɔ mi blɔ, puje he kɛ pu sinɔ he. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />A fia gbogbo ɔmɛ ngɔ fɔ tɛhi nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ nɔ kaa sisi tomi tɛhi. Nɛ a ngma Tobi ɔ e kaseli nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ ɔmɛ a biɛhi ngɛ a nɔ.<verse eid="REV 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Bɔfo ɔ hɛɛ nɔ́ susumi tso nɛ a kɛ sika tsu pee ngɛ e dɛ mi nɛ e ma kɛ susu ma a kɛ e agbo ɔmɛ kɛ gbogbo ɔmɛ. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Nɛ benɛ e susu lɛ ɔ, e na kaa e ngɛ kɔ nya eywiɛ nɛ e blimi ngɛ kaa e kami. E si temi ngɛ kaa e kasa kpa amɛ pɛpɛɛpɛ, lɔ ɔ ji, e he fɛɛ he kami ji si tomi he akpe kɛ e nya lafa enuɔ. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Jehanɛ ɔ, e susu gbogbo ɔmɛ a timi, nɛ e na kaa a peeɔ nane lafa enyɔ kɛ e nya nyɔngma kɛ ekpa kɛ je kasa kake kɛ ya kasa kake. Nɛ bɔfo ɔ tsɛ susumi ɔmɛ nɛ a kɛ susumi nɔ́ nɛ ngɛ kaa nɔmlɔ kɔni kami susu ɔ, a yi bɔ ɔmɛ kɛ ha mi.<verse eid="REV 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />A fia gbogbo ɔ kɛ tɛ ko nɛ ngɛ kaa ahuhuɛ ɔ, nɛ ma a nitsɛ lɛɛ sika tsu kpakpa nɛ mi tsɔ kaa ahuhuɛ i. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Nɛ tɛhi nɛ a kɛ pee gbogbo ɔmɛ a sisi tomi ɔ, a ngɔ afɛu tɛ slɔɔtohi nɛ he jua wa kɛ dla he. Kekle sisi tomi tɛ ɔ ji jaspa, nɔ́ nɛ ji enyɔne ɔ safiro, etɛne ɔ kalkedoni, eywiɛne ɔ emerald, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />enuɔne ɔ sardoniki, ekpane ɔ sardus, kpaagone ɔ krisolite, kpaanyɔne ɔ berilo, nɛɛne ɔ topaz, nyɔngmane ɔ krisoprase, nyɔngma kɛ kakene ɔ jakinto, nyɔngma kɛ enyɔne ɔ ametisto. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Nɛ muɛ nɛ he jua wa nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ a kɛ pee agbohi nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ ɔmɛ, agbo fɛɛ agbo ɔ, a kɛ muɛ nɛ he jua wa kake pee. Nɛ gbɛjegbɛ pɔtɛɛ nɛ ngɛ ma a mi ɔ, sika tsu kpakpa nɛ mi tsɔ kaa ahuhuɛ nɛ a kɛ pee.<verse eid="REV 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />I nɛ sɔlemi tsu ko ngɛ ma a mi, ejakaa a jaa Nutsɔ Mawu Ope ɔ kɛ Tobi ɔ ngɛ ma a he fɛɛ he. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Nɛ pu loo hlami he hia we ma a kɛ ha e mi tsɔmi. Ejakaa Mawu kɛ Tobi ɔ a anunyami ha nɛ ma a mi ngɛ kpɛe. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />E la a ma kpɛ ngɛ je mi ma amɛ a mi, nɛ je mi matsɛ ɔmɛ maa ngɔ a anunyami kɛ ba ha lɛ. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />E agbo ɔmɛ nga we gblee; a bli mɛ be fɛɛ be, ejakaa diblii be! <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Nɛ a maa ngɔ ma amɛ tsuo a anunyami kɛ a bumi kɛ ba e mi. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />A be blɔ ngmɛe nɛ nɔ́ yayami ko maa ba e mi, kaa ajuama bɔlɔ loo lakpatsɛ, se mohu nihi nɛ a ngma a biɛhi ngɛ Tobi ɔ Wami Womi ɔ mi ɔ pɛ.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="s1">Wami pa a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Nɛ e tsɔɔ mi pa ko nɛ Wami Nyu nɛ mi tsɔ keikei ngɛ bee ngɛ mi kɛ je Mawu kɛ Tobi ɔ matsɛ sɛ ɔ mi <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />kɛ ngɛ ma gbɛjegbɛ ɔ kpɛti gue. Wami tsohi maa si ngɛ pa a kasa hiɛ kɛ hiɛ, nɛ e woɔ yiblii si nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ daa jeha, si kake daa hlami; nɛ a ngɔɔ e ba amɛ kɛ peeɔ tsopa kɛ tsaa nɔ.<verse eid="REV 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Nɔ́ yobu ko be ma a mi hie, ejakaa Mawu kɛ Tobi ɔ matsɛ sɛ ɔ maa hi lejɛ ɔ, nɛ e sɔmɔli ɔmɛ ma ja lɛ. <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />A maa na e hɛ mi; nɛ a maa ngma e biɛ ngɛ a hɛ nya. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Diblii be woe ngɛ lejɛ ɔ, nɛ kane loo pu he be hiae, ejakaa Nutsɔ Mawu ɔ maa pee a kane, nɛ a maa ye matsɛ kɛ ya neneene.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Kɛkɛ nɛ bɔfo ɔ de mi ke, “Anɔkuale munyuhi ji enɛ ɔmɛ nɛ, e sa nɛ a he nɛ a ye. Nɛ Nutsɔ Mawu ɔ, nɔ nɛ deɔ e gbali ɔmɛ nihi nɛ maa ba a, tsɔ e bɔfo ɔ nɛ e ba tsɔɔ e sɔmɔli ɔmɛ níhi nɛ maa ba ngɛ be kpiti mi ɔ.”<verse eid="REV 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />Nɛ Yesu de ke, “Nyɛɛ bu tue! I ma nɔuu. A jɔɔ nihi kulaa nɛ ma he gbami munyu nɛ ɔmɛ ngɛ womi nɛ ɔ mi ɔ maa ye ɔ.”<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Ami Yohane, i na, nɛ i nu nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ kulaa, nɛ i kpla si nɛ ma ja bɔfo ɔ nɛ tsɔɔ mi mɛ ɔ. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Se e kpale nɛ e de mi ekohu ke, “Dabi, koo pee nɔ ko kaa ja. Ami hu Yesu sɔmɔlɔ ji mi kaa mo kɛ o nyɛmimɛ gbali ɔmɛ, kɛ nihi kulaa nɛ buɔ anɔkuale ɔ nɛ a ngma ngɛ womi nɛ ɔ mi tue ɔ. Mo ja Mawu pɛ.”<verse eid="REV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Jehanɛ ɔ, e de mi ke, “Koo sɔu womi nɛ ɔ mi gbami munyu ɔmɛ a nya, ejakaa be ɔ nɛ enɛ ɔmɛ kulaa maa ba mi ɔ su ta. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Nɔ nɛ ngɛ yayami pee ɔ, e ya nɔ nɛ e pee yayami ɔ, nɛ mutsɛ e ya nɔ nɛ e tsu e mu ni ɔmɛ, nɛ kpakpa peelɔ e pee e kpakpa a, nɛ nɔ nɛ ngɛ klɔuklɔu ɔ, e ya nɔ nɛ e hi klɔuklɔu.”<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I ma nɔuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />“Hyɛ, i ma nɔuu, nɛ i hɛɛ ye hiɔwo ɔ. I ma wo nɔ tsuaa nɔ hiɔ ngɛ e ni tsumi ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />Ami ji A kɛ Z, Sisije kɛ Nyagbe ɔ, Kekle kɛ Sekpɛ ɔ. <verse eid="REV 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />A jɔɔ nihi kulaa nɛ ngɛ a tade ɔmɛ a he fɔe konɛ a na he blɔ kɛ gu agbo ɔ nya kɛ sɛ ma a mi nɛ a ye Wami Tso ɔ nɔ yiblii ɔ eko ɔ.<verse eid="REV 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Nɛ nihi nɛ ngɛ ma a se ji, nihi nɛ tla blɔ kɛ je Mawu he, nyuali ɔmɛ, ajuama bɔli kɛ nɔ gbeli; amaga jali kɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ suɔ lakpa yemi nɛ e peeɔ ja a. <verse eid="REV 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />Ami Yesu, i tsɔ ye bɔfo ɔ kɛ ba nyɛ ngɔ konɛ e ba de asafo ɔmɛ ní nɛ ɔmɛ kulaa. David sipoku kɛ e bibimibi ji mi. Ami ji Nɔkɔ nɛ ngɛ kpɛe ɔ nɛ.” <verse eid="REV 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Nɛ Mumi ɔ kɛ Ayɛflo ɔ de ke, “Ba”. Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ kuma ngɛ lɛ yee ɔ e ba. Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ suɔ kaa e maa ba a, e ba nɛ e ba nu Wami Nyu ɔ eko yaka gu. <verse eid="REV 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Nɛ i ngɛ nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ maa kane womi nɛ ɔ kɔkɔ bɔe ke, ke nɔ ko ngɔ nɔ́ ko ke piɛ nɔ́ nɛ a ngma ngɛ hiɛ ɔ he ɔ, Mawu maa ngɔ ajahi nɛ a tsɔɔ ngɛ womi nɛ ɔ mi ɔ kɛ piɛ he ha lɛ. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Nɛ ke nɔ ko je nɔ́ ko kɛ je gbami munyu ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ womi nɛ ɔ mi ɔ mi ɔ, Mawu ma kpɔ e blɔ nya nɛ e ngɛ ngɛ Wami Tso ɔ mi kɛ Ma Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ a je kɛ tsɔɔ ɔ mi ɔ ngɛ e dɛ.<verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />“Nɔ nɛ de ní nɛ ɔmɛ kulaa a ngɛ dee faii ke, Ee, i ma nɔuu!” Amen! Nutsɔ Yesu, ba!<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo dloomi ɔ nɛ kɛ nyɛ tsuo nɛ hi si. Amen!<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>